(2255, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 60, 2, 'BANGKOK - DAMNOEN | BREAKFAST/LUNCH/CRUISE', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the Hotel, Transfer to <strong>Damnoen Saduak Floating Market </strong>(include Boat Canal Tour around 45-60 minutes), <strong>Meaklong Railway Market, </strong>Lunch at Local Restaurant, Back to Bangkok, Erawadee Herb Shop, Icon Siam &amp; Sook Siam Floating Market in the mall, <strong>including Chaophraya Dinner Cruise</strong>, Back to the hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-29 08:06:33', '2026-04-29 08:06:33'),
