(4851, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 30, 3, 'TIMANG – BREKSI', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast at hotel, visit <strong>Timang Beach</strong> that is famous for its traditional gondola, formerly used for local fishermen to get lobsters. Now, it is open for tourist as an optional gondola or bridge (personal account).&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Next, we take you to <strong>Breksi Cliff</strong> as the ruin of limestone mining that remains beautiful giant cliff.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Dinner at local restaurant (Optional), back to hotel, free program.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-06-03 07:38:37', '2026-06-03 07:38:37'),
