(6914, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 10, 2, 'BUNAKEN SIGHTSEEING TOUR – LOCAL COFFEE PRODUCTION HOUSE – SHOPPING TOUR', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast at the hotel, the tour participants will be picked up by the guide and head to <strong>Bunaken Island</strong>. From the hotel, transfer to Megamas Pier and cross to Bunaken by boat for approximately 30 minutes. Bunaken Island now features the newly developed <strong>Bunaken Tourism Pier (New Bunaken)</strong>, offering a more charming and photogenic spot for photos and videos.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Afterwards, the tour participants will be taken to explore the beauty of <strong>Bunaken Marine Park</strong>, renowned for its colorful coral reefs and diverse tropical marine life. Guests may enjoy <i>optional</i><strong> snorkeling or diving</strong> activities, or simply take a leisurely walk while relaxing and enjoying the beach atmosphere of Bunaken. Optional lunch at a local restaurant. &nbsp;After lunch, guests will have additional free time for optional snorkeling/diving.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Return to Megamas Pier and proceed to visit a <strong>local coffee production house</strong>, where participants can taste the authentic flavors of North Sulawesi coffee. Afterwards, continue to a <strong>souvenir shopping area</strong> offering a wide variety of Manado specialties (or return to the hotel first and be picked up again before dinner). Optional dinner at a local restaurant, followed by transfer back to the hotel.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:38:23', '2026-07-14 02:38:23'),
(6915, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 10, 3, 'MINAHASA HIGHLAND TOUR', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast at the hotel, the participants will be picked up by the tour guide for a full-day excursion to the <strong>Minahasa Highlands</strong>, passing through the Tinoor area where guests can enjoy panoramic views of Manado City from an altitude of 500 meters.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Upon arrival in Tomohon, visit the <strong>Pelangi Tourism Park</strong>, where participants can admire the beauty of various colorful flowers. Continue to the <strong>Tomohon Extreme Market</strong>, where guests can see a variety of wild meats such as bats, forest rats, snakes, and other exotic animals. At a separate spot, guests may also witness the <strong>live cooking</strong> process of Manado traditional snacks such as <i>kue cucur</i>, <i>apang gula merah</i>, <i>dodol</i>, and other local delicacies.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">The tour continues to <strong>Tuur Maasering</strong>, a forest of aren (palm) trees featuring several Instagrammable photo spots. Here, participants can also observe the traditional production of the local liquor <strong>“Cap Tikus,”</strong> made through the fermentation and distillation of aren tree sap.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Optional lunch at a local restaurant. After lunch, the journey continues to <strong>Bukit Kasih</strong>, a unique natural attraction featuring active sulfur craters and stairways leading to the hilltop, offering scenic views and a distinctive cultural experience. The area also has natural sulfur hot springs where guests may swim or soak their feet for relaxation (optional).</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Next, visit <strong>Lake Linow</strong>, a sulfur lake famous for its ever-changing watercolors and beautiful scenery, where coffee or tea will be served. Return to Manado City. Optional dinner at a local restaurant, followed by transfer back to the hotel.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:38:23', '2026-07-14 02:38:23'),
(6916, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 10, 4, 'LIHAGA ISLAND – BUDO TOURISM VILLAGE', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast at the hotel, the participants will be picked up by the tour guide and travel to the Likupang area, approximately 1 hour and 20 minutes from Manado city center. The first stop is <strong>Serei Port</strong>, and upon arrival, continue by boat for about 15 minutes to <strong>Lihaga Island</strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">On <strong>Lihaga Island</strong>, participants can enjoy its stunning white and powder-soft sandy beaches, explore the island, and take photos at various beautiful and Instagrammable spots. Guests may also join optional activities such as snorkeling, canoeing, or diving. Lunch will be served on the island. After lunch, participants will have additional free time to relax by the beach.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">On the return journey to Manado, make a stop at <strong>Budo Tourism Village</strong>, where guests can enjoy a beautiful sunset accompanied by local treats of fried bananas and fresh coconut. Optional dinner at a local restaurant, followed by transfer back to the hotel.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:38:23', '2026-07-14 02:38:23'),
(6917, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 10, 5, 'TRANSFER OUT – DEPARTURE', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast and completing the hotel check-out process, the tour participants will be picked up by the guide and transferred directly to the airport for their return flight. Tour ends.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:38:23', '2026-07-14 02:38:23'),
(6922, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 28, 1, 'ARRIVAL MANADO - PARADISE GOLF RESORT', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setibanya di Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado, Anda akan disambut oleh tim kami dan langsung diantar menuju Paradise Hotel &amp; Golf Resort yang terletak di kawasan pesisir Sulawesi Utara dengan suasana tenang dan pemandangan yang menyejukkan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan menuju resort memakan waktu sekitar 60–90 menit. Setelah tiba, proses check-in dilakukan dan sisa hari dapat digunakan untuk beristirahat atau menikmati fasilitas resort. Nikmati suasana santai, udara segar, serta pemandangan lapangan golf yang membentang di tengah lanskap tropis yang indah.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menginap di Paradise Hotel &amp; Golf Resort.</p>', NULL, 'No Meals', '2026-07-14 02:39:48', '2026-07-14 02:39:48'),
(6923, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 28, 2, 'PARADISE GOLF EXPERIENCE (18 HOLES)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi di hotel, saatnya menikmati pengalaman bermain golf di salah satu lapangan golf terbaik di Sulawesi Utara.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Nikmati permainan golf 18 holes lengkap dengan fasilitas golf cart dan caddy yang telah disediakan. Lapangan golf menawarkan kombinasi fairway yang menantang dengan panorama alam yang memukau, menciptakan pengalaman bermain yang menyenangkan baik bagi golfer berpengalaman maupun pemula.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah permainan selesai, Anda dapat bersantai di resort, menikmati suasana sekitar, atau menghabiskan waktu luang bersama keluarga dan rekan perjalanan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menginap di Paradise Hotel &amp; Golf Resort.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:39:48', '2026-07-14 02:39:48'),
(6924, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 28, 3, 'LIHAGA ISLAND WHITE SAND ESCAPE', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi, perjalanan dilanjutkan menuju Pelabuhan Serei sebelum menyeberang dengan private boat menuju Pulau Lihaga, salah satu pulau tropis terindah di Sulawesi Utara yang terkenal dengan pasir putihnya yang sangat halus dan air laut yang jernih berwarna biru kehijauan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Nikmati waktu untuk bersantai di pantai, berenang, berfoto, atau sekadar menikmati keindahan pulau yang masih alami. Bagi yang ingin beraktivitas lebih, tersedia pilihan snorkeling, canoeing, maupun glass bottom boat (opsional) untuk menikmati keindahan bawah laut sekitar pulau.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Makan siang akan disajikan di pulau dengan menu khas Sulawesi Utara berupa ikan bakar segar yang disajikan bersama sambal dabu-dabu khas Manado. Setelah menikmati keindahan Pulau Lihaga, perjalanan kembali ke Pelabuhan Serei dan dilanjutkan menuju hotel.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sore hari bebas untuk beristirahat dan menikmati suasana resort.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menginap di Paradise Hotel &amp; Golf Resort.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:39:48', '2026-07-14 02:39:48'),
(6925, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 28, 4, 'DEPARTURE MANADO', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi dan proses check-out hotel, Anda memiliki waktu santai sebelum keberangkatan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pada waktu yang telah ditentukan, tim kami akan mengantar Anda menuju Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado untuk penerbangan selanjutnya.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Dengan berakhirnya perjalanan ini, semoga pengalaman bermain golf dan menikmati keindahan Pulau Lihaga menjadi kenangan yang menyenangkan selama berlibur di Sulawesi Utara.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>End of Program</strong></p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:39:48', '2026-07-14 02:39:48'),
(6936, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 34, 1, 'ARRIVAL MANADO', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setibanya di Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado, Anda akan disambut oleh tim kami dan diantar menuju hotel atau resort pilihan untuk proses check-in. Perjalanan menuju akomodasi memakan waktu sekitar 30–60 menit tergantung lokasi hotel.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sisa hari dapat digunakan untuk beristirahat, menikmati fasilitas hotel, atau bersantai sambil menikmati suasana pesisir Sulawesi Utara sebagai persiapan untuk petualangan bawah laut yang akan dimulai keesokan harinya.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menginap di hotel atau resort pilihan.</p>', NULL, 'Dinner', '2026-07-14 02:59:14', '2026-07-14 02:59:14'),
(6937, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 34, 2, 'BUNAKEN DIVING EXPERIENCE', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi, perjalanan dilanjutkan menuju Taman Laut Bunaken yang terkenal sebagai salah satu destinasi diving terbaik di Indonesia. Dengan menggunakan boat diving, Anda akan mengunjungi beberapa dive site pilihan untuk menjelajahi dinding karang spektakuler, taman karang berwarna-warni, dan ekosistem laut yang kaya akan kehidupan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Bunaken terkenal dengan wall diving yang menakjubkan, visibilitas yang baik, serta kesempatan untuk melihat penyu hijau, penyu sisik, berbagai spesies ikan karang tropis, hingga predator laut seperti barracuda dan reef shark. Setelah aktivitas diving selesai, kembali ke hotel untuk makan siang dan menikmati waktu bebas.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-14 02:59:14', '2026-07-14 02:59:14'),
(6938, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 34, 3, 'BUNAKEN DIVING EXPERIENCE', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan pagi sebelum kembali menjelajahi keindahan bawah laut Bunaken. Hari ini Anda akan mengunjungi dive site berbeda yang menawarkan karakter unik dengan kombinasi coral garden, reef wall, dan kehidupan laut yang berlimpah.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Nikmati kesempatan untuk menyaksikan berbagai spesies laut tropis, mulai dari ikan karang berwarna-warni hingga makhluk laut kecil yang bersembunyi di antara terumbu karang. Setelah menyelesaikan program diving, kembali ke hotel untuk beristirahat dan menikmati suasana santai di sore hari.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-14 02:59:14', '2026-07-14 02:59:14'),
(6939, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 34, 4, 'TUNAN WATERFALL & TANGKOKO WILDLIFE TOUR', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi, perjalanan menuju kawasan Talawaan untuk mengunjungi Air Terjun Tunan yang tersembunyi di tengah hutan tropis. Air terjun setinggi sekitar 86 meter ini menawarkan suasana alami yang menyegarkan dan menjadi salah satu hidden gem di Sulawesi Utara.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan dilanjutkan menuju Cagar Alam Tangkoko, kawasan konservasi satwa liar paling terkenal di Sulawesi Utara. Ditemani ranger lokal berpengalaman, Anda akan melakukan trekking ringan menyusuri hutan hujan tropis untuk mencari berbagai satwa endemik seperti Yaki (Sulawesi Black Crested Macaque), Tarsius, Burung Rangkong (Hornbill), dan Kuskus yang hidup bebas di habitat alaminya.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah menikmati pengalaman wildlife yang unik, perjalanan kembali menuju Manado dan kembali ke hotel.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-14 02:59:14', '2026-07-14 02:59:14'),
(6940, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 34, 5, 'DEPARTURE MANADO', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi dan proses check-out, Anda akan dijemput dan diantar menuju Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado sesuai jadwal penerbangan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Dengan berakhirnya perjalanan ini, semoga pengalaman menjelajahi keindahan bawah laut Bunaken dan bertemu satwa endemik Sulawesi di Tangkoko menjadi kenangan yang tak terlupakan selama berada di Sulawesi Utara.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>End of Program</strong></p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-14 02:59:14', '2026-07-14 02:59:14'),
(6948, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 22, 1, 'JAKARTA – OSAKA (Meals on board)', '<p>Hari ini kita berkumpul di bandara Seokarno-Hatta untuk berangkat menuju ke Osaka dengan menggunakan pesawat Malaysia Airlines<br>Bermalam di pesawat</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:02:46', '2026-07-14 03:02:46'),
(6949, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 22, 2, 'OSAKA – KYOTO - GIFU (X)', '<p>Setelah sampai di Jepang, kita akan disambut guide yang ramah, setelah itu anda akan langsung diajak untuk mengunjungi mengunjungi<br>Shinsaibashi – Dotonbori yang merupakan daerah pusat perbelanjaan yang iconic dengan papan iklan glico mannya. Kemudian, kita akan<br>mengunjungi Fushimi Inari yang merupakan kuil Shinto dan juga kuil pusat bagi sekitar 40.000 kuil Inari yang memuliakan Inari. (Khusus<br>penerbangan dengan Philipine Airline/PR langsung menuju check-in hotel Istirahat). Terakhir kita akan mengunjungi Kiyomizu Temple /<br>Kinkakuji Temple (DEPENDS ON SITUASION)yang merupakan kuil Budha kuno yang dibangun sejak tahun 798 dan mengalami 10 kali kerusakan akibat perang dan bencana alam. Kemudian kita akan melakukan perjalanan ke Gifu, Check-in hotel istirahat<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Bermalam di Hotel *** or similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:02:46', '2026-07-14 03:02:46'),
(6950, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 22, 3, 'GIFU – SHIRAKAWAGO – TAKAYAMA – MATSUMOTO (Makan Pagi)', '<p>Setelah santap pagi, kita akan mengunjungi Shirakawago Village disini kita dapat melihat rumah tradisional Jepang yaitu gassho-zukuri.<br>Kemudian kita akan menuju Takayama old town yang merupakan kawasan pedesaan dengan bangunan tradisional Jepang yang masih dipelihara dan berfungsi hingga hari ini, disini kita dapat berbelanja souvenir khas Jepang. Dilanjutkan menuju Matsumoto. Check-in hotel<br>istirahat.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Bermalam di Hotel *** or similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:02:46', '2026-07-14 03:02:46'),
(6951, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 22, 4, 'MATSUMOTO – MT.FUJI (Makan Pagi, Makan Malam)', '<p>Setelah santap pagi. Kita akan mengunjungi Gunung Fuji yang merupakan gunung terindah dan tertinggi di Jepang, Dilanjutkan menuju<br>Oshino Hakkai Village di sini anda dapat menikmati suasana desa di jepang yang terkenal akan 8 sumber mata air alaminya. Kemudian, kita<br>akan menuju Lake Kawaguchi di sini kita dapat bersantai sambil berswafoto dengan pemandangan Gunung Fuji yang indah. Check-in hotel istirahat.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Bermalam di Hotel *** or similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:02:46', '2026-07-14 03:02:46'),
(6952, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 22, 5, 'KAWAGUCHI – GOTEMBA – TOKYO (Makan Pagi)', '<p>Setelah santap pagi, kemudian kita juga akan berbelanja di premium outlet terbesar di Jepang, Gotemba Premium Outlet, disini anda dapat<br>berbelanja berbagai macam brand ternama. Kemudian kita akan menuju Asakusa dan Photoshop di Tokyo Sky Tree. Setelah itu kita akan menuju Odaiba disini terdapat monument robot transformer yang sangat besar.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Bermalam di Hotel *** or similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:02:46', '2026-07-14 03:02:46'),
(6953, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 22, 6, 'TOKYO FREE DAY (Makan Pagi)', '<p>Setelah santap pagi, hari ini anda dapat bebas menjelajah kota Tokyo seharian (NO BUS, NO GUIDE).<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Bermalam di Hotel *** or similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:02:46', '2026-07-14 03:02:46'),
(6954, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 22, 7, 'KUALA LUMPUR - JAKARTA (Meals on Board)', '<p>Hari ini kita akan melakukan perjalanan ke bandara Soekarno Hatta Jakarta. Sampai jumpa di perjalanan menyenangkan bersama kami<br>berikutnya.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:02:46', '2026-07-14 03:02:46'),
(6955, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 61, 1, 'ARR - BANGKOK | NO MEALS', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pick up at the airport, Transfer to check in hotel, overnight at Bangkok</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:04:16', '2026-07-14 03:04:16'),
(6956, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 61, 2, 'BANGKOK - PATTAYA | BREAKFAST/LUNCH/DINNER', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at Hotel, Check out from hotel, Visit Honey Bee farm, <strong>Great and Grand Sweet Destination</strong>, Bus tour to <strong>The Valley of Dinosaurs (Dinosaurs Park)</strong>, <strong>Nongnooch Village (Include Thai Culture and Elephant Show) </strong>Lunch buffet at Nongnooch Village, <strong>Laser Buddha Hill, </strong>Erawadee Herb Shop, Pattaya Beach at <strong>Hard Rock Cafe</strong>, optional cabaret show, Dinner at Local restaurant, Check in hotel at Pattaya.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:04:16', '2026-07-14 03:04:16'),
(6957, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 61, 3, 'PATTAYA - BANGKOK | BREAKFAST/LUNCH COUPON', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">ABF at hotel, check out from hotel, Back to Bangkok, Gems Gallery Museum of The Stone with Train Ride, back Bangkok, Dried Food local Product Center, <strong>Platinum Fashion Mall</strong>, Lunch at Platinum Mall by Coupon <strong>THB150/pax</strong>, <strong>Wat Arun </strong>(Temple of Dawn), <strong>Chaophraya River </strong>sightseeing with <strong>Tourist Boat </strong>to <strong>Icon Siam Mall &amp; Sook Siam Floating Market in The Mall</strong>, Dinner by own expense at <strong>Asia Tique the Riverfront Night Market</strong>, transfer to check in hotel at the Bangkok.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:04:16', '2026-07-14 03:04:16'),
(6958, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 61, 4, 'DEPARTURES | BREAKFAST', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">ABF at Hotel, free time until transfer to the airport</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 03:04:16', '2026-07-14 03:04:16'),
(6973, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 16, 1, 'Itinerary', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">All participants will be picked up for a trip to <strong>Tunan Waterfall</strong>, located in <strong>Talawaan Village</strong>. The water source of Tunan Waterfall originates from a mountain river that flows forcefully down a steep cliff about <strong>86 meters high</strong>. The pristine forest and natural surroundings enhance the beauty of this scenic natural attraction.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Afterward, participants will enjoy lunch at a local restaurant. The journey then continues to the <strong>Tangkoko Nature Reserve</strong>. Sit back and relax while enjoying the beautiful scenery as you pass through small villages on the way to one of Indonesia’s most important conservation areas.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Located about <strong>20 kilometers northwest of Bitung</strong>, the reserve lies among hills and valleys. Upon arrival, you will be greeted by a<strong> local park ranger</strong>, who will guide you through the forest in search of various wildlife species roaming freely in their natural habitat. Keep your camera ready—you may encounter the <strong>Sulawesi Black Crested Macaque (Yaki)</strong>, <strong>the Tarsius Tarsier (the world’s smallest primate)</strong>, as well as <strong>Hornbills</strong> and <strong>Cuscus (large-eyed marsupials)</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After the wildlife exploration, return to Manado. End of tour.</p>', NULL, 'Lunch', '2026-07-14 03:43:38', '2026-07-14 03:43:38'),
(6974, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 106, 1, 'Jakarta - Danang', 'Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 for the flight to Danang via Malaysia Airlines. Welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit the Dragon Bridge & Love Bridge, shop at the Son Tra Night Market, then transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:21:48', '2026-07-14 06:21:48'),
(6975, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 106, 2, 'Danang - Hai Van - Lang Co - Incense Making Village - Hue Citadel (BLD)', 'Travel to Hue, the former imperial capital of Vietnam, crossing the Hai Van Pass. Visit the Incense Making Village, Khai Dinh Tomb, and take a cruise along the Perfume River (Song Huong River) to visit Thien Mu Pagoda.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:21:48', '2026-07-14 06:21:48'),
(6976, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 106, 3, 'Hue - Ba Na Hills & Golden Bridge - Danang (BLD)', 'Ride the cable car to Ba Na Station, visit the Golden Bridge at 1,400 metres above sea level, Fantasy Park, Chua Mountain and Ba Chua Thuong Temple, followed by the Han Market before returning to the hotel in Danang.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:21:48', '2026-07-14 06:21:48'),
(6977, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 106, 4, 'Danang (BL)', 'Visit the Son Tra Peninsula and its 67-metre Bodhisattva statue, followed by Cam Thanh Water Coconut Village (Bay Mau Coconut Forest) and Hoi An Ancient Town (Hokien Temple, Chinese Assembly Halls, Tan Ky Ancestral House, Japanese Bridge, Hoi An Local Market).', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:21:48', '2026-07-14 06:21:48'),
(6978, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 106, 5, 'Danang - Jakarta', 'Free time until the transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta via Malaysia Airlines.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:21:48', '2026-07-14 06:21:48'),
(6979, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 105, 1, 'Arrival - Ha Noi (D)', 'Arrival and welcome at Noi Bai International Airport, then transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest. Overnight in Ha Noi.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:33:00', '2026-07-14 06:33:00'),
(6980, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 105, 2, 'Ha Noi - Sa Pa (B/L/D)', 'Journey to Sa Pa, visiting Cat Cat Village, followed by Cau May Street and the Sa Pa Night Market. Overnight in Sa Pa.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:33:00', '2026-07-14 06:33:00'),
(6981, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 105, 3, 'Sa Pa (B/L/D)', 'Explore Fansipan Mountain and enjoy the atmosphere at Moana Café. Overnight in Sa Pa.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:33:00', '2026-07-14 06:33:00'),
(6982, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 105, 4, 'Sa Pa - Ha Noi (B/L/D)', 'Return to Ha Noi, visiting Hoan Kiem Lake, Ngoc Son Temple, and the Hanoi Old Quarter, with shopping at Dong Xuan Market. Overnight in Ha Noi.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:33:00', '2026-07-14 06:33:00'),
(6983, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 105, 5, 'Ha Noi - Ha Long (B/L/D)', 'Private day cruise across Halong Bay, visiting Paradise Grotto, Kissing Chicken Rock, Thien Cung Caves, and Dau Go Caves, with a fresh seafood lunch on board. Return to Ha Noi for the overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:33:00', '2026-07-14 06:33:00'),
(6984, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 105, 6, 'Ha Noi - Departure (B)', 'After breakfast, transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta. End of tour services.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 06:33:00', '2026-07-14 06:33:00'),
(6990, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 107, 1, 'Jakarta - Hanoi', 'Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 for the flight to Hanoi. Welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide at Noi Bai Airport; if time permits, explore the Hanoi Old Quarter before hotel check-in (First Eden Hotel or similar).', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 07:05:01', '2026-07-14 07:05:01'),
(6991, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 107, 2, 'Hanoi - Sapa - Cat Cat Village (BL)', 'Journey to Sapa enjoying panoramas of mountains and rice fields, lunch, then visit Cat Cat Village (an H\'mong village), the French-era Hydro Electric Power Station, Sapa Church, and Sapa Lake. Overnight at Sapa Panorama Hotel or similar.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 07:05:01', '2026-07-14 07:05:01'),
(6992, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 107, 3, 'Sapa Fansipan The Roof of Indochina - Hanoi (BLD)', 'Head to Fansipan Mountain by cable car enjoying panoramas of the Hoang Lien Son mountain range, followed by a trek of about 1.5 hours to the summit of Fansipan (optional Funicular ride). Return to Hanoi, overnight at First Eden Hotel or similar.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 07:05:01', '2026-07-14 07:05:01'),
(6993, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 107, 4, 'Hanoi - Halong Island Tour - Hanoi (BL)', 'Travel to Halong for the Halong Bay Cruise, visiting Thien Cung Cave, Dau Go Grotto, and karst formations such as Incense Bowl Islet, Cock Fighting Islet, Sail Islet, and Turtle Island. Return to Hanoi to visit the Mega Grand World Mall.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 07:05:01', '2026-07-14 07:05:01'),
(6994, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 107, 5, 'Hanoi - Jakarta', 'Free time until the transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-14 07:05:01', '2026-07-14 07:05:01'),
(7185, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 50, 1, 'JAKARTA - SYDNEY', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Malam ini kita berkumpul di Bandara Soekarno-Hatta terminal 3 Ultimate untuk berangkat menuju ke Incheon dengan Maskapai bintang 5 versi Skytrax dengan penerbangan langsung.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><i>Bermalam di Hotel</i>***/similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 12:40:38', '2026-07-17 12:40:38'),
(7186, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 50, 2, 'SYDNEY CITY TOUR', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setiba di Sydney, Australia, kita akan ke mengunjungi <i>Icon </i>dari Kota Sydney<i>, <strong>Sydney Opera House</strong></i><strong>, </strong>gedung serbaguna yang digunakan untuk Kegiatan seni dengan arsitektur terkenal dari abad 20. Kemudian kita akan berkeliling menuju <i><strong>The Rocks &amp; Circular Quay</strong></i><strong>, </strong>kawasan<strong> </strong>area di bawah jembatan <i><strong>Sydney Harbor Bridge</strong></i><strong> </strong>yang terletak di pinggir Pelabuhan Sydney yang terkenal dengan perbelanjaan fashion dan makanan. Dilanjutkan dengan kunjungan ke <i><strong>Royal Botanical Garden</strong></i><strong> </strong>dan <i><strong>Mrs. Macquarie’s Chair</strong></i><strong>, </strong>sebuah bangku yang diukir dari batu oleh para tahanan di zaman itu sebagai sebuah peringatan dari Pemimpin Australia saat itu untuk istrinya. Di Perjalanan menuju <i><strong>Bondi Beach</strong></i><strong>, </strong>kita akan menuju <i><strong>The Gap</strong></i><strong>, </strong>sebuah Jurang yang terbentuk secara alami dengan pemandangan Laut yang indah. Malam hari kita menuju <i><strong>QVB Mall.</strong></i><strong> </strong><i>Check in hotel</i> dan istirahat.&nbsp;</p><p><i>Bermalam di Hotel</i>***/similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 12:40:38', '2026-07-17 12:40:38'),
(7187, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 50, 3, 'SYDNEY FREE DAY (MAKAN PAGI)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel, kita mendapatkan waktu bebas untuk <i>explore </i>Kota Sydney seharian<i><strong>.</strong></i><strong> </strong>Kembali ke<i> </i>hotel dan istirahat<strong>.&nbsp;(</strong><i><strong>No Guide, No Transport, No Tour Leader)</strong></i></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><i>Bermalam di Hotel</i>***/similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 12:40:38', '2026-07-17 12:40:38'),
(7188, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 50, 4, 'SYDNEY - MELBOURNE (MAKAN PAGI)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>DOMESTIC FLIGHT</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan pagi dengan <i>Box Meal, </i>Kita <i>Check-out </i>Hotel dan menuju <i>Airport </i>untuk penerbangan menuju <strong>Kota Melbourne</strong><i>. </i>Setibanya di Melbourne, kita menuju <i><strong>Parliament House Melbourne</strong></i><strong> </strong>(<i>Photostop), <strong>St. Patrick Cathedral</strong></i><strong> </strong><i>(Photostop), <strong>Fitzroy Garden</strong></i><strong>, </strong>sebuah taman seluas 26 Hektar yang dibuat dengan desain era Ratu Victoria. Sore hari kita menuju <i><strong>Shrine of Remembrance</strong></i><strong>, </strong>sebuah monumen pahlawan dengan gaya arsitektur Yunani dan digunakan untuk memperingati dan menghormati para pahlawan yang gugur di Perang Dunia I, tapi sekarang digunakan untuk mengenang pahlawan di semua medan perang yang pernah ada. Setelah itu kita menuju <i><strong>St. Kilda Beach</strong></i><strong> </strong>untuk menikmati suasana pantai dan dapat melihat kumpulin Pondok warna warni di pantainya. <i>Check-in</i> hotel dan istirahat</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><i>Bermalam di Hotel</i>***/similar</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 12:40:38', '2026-07-17 12:40:38'),
(7189, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 50, 5, 'MELBOURNE CITY TOUR (MAKAN PAGI)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan pagi di hotel, kita akan mengunjungi <i>Queen Victoria Market</i> untuk melihat suasana pasar dan berbelanja. Dilanjutkan dengan kunjungan menuju <i>Islamic Council of Victoria</i>. Kemudian kita akan menuju <i>Moonlit Sanctuary,</i> disini kita dapat melihat Kangguru dan Koala, Binatang asli khas Australia. Dilanjutkan dengan perjalanan menuju <i>The Nobbies</i>, tempat yang berada di ujung tebing pantai dan digunakan untuk mengamati koloni Anjing Laut oleh para pengamat. Disini kita juga dapat menikmati ‘<i>Penguin Parade’. </i>Kembali ke hotel dan istirahat.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><i>Bermalam di Hotel</i> setaraf ***</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><i>(Jika tiket Phillip Island habis saat group closing, maka dapat digantikan dengan Sovereign Hill atau Great Ocean atau lainnya, sesuai dengan kebijakan penyelenggara yang diumumkan saat final confirmation, dan tidak bisa diganggu gugat)&nbsp;</i></p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 12:40:38', '2026-07-17 12:40:38'),
(7190, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 50, 6, 'MELBOURNE FREE DAY (MAKAN PAGI)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel, kita mendapatkan waktu bebas untuk <i>explore </i>Kota Melbourne seharian<i>.</i> Kembali ke<i> </i>hotel dan istirahat.&nbsp;(<i>No Guide, No Transport, No Tour Leader)</i></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><i><strong>Bermalam di Hotel</strong></i><strong> setaraf ***</strong></p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 12:40:38', '2026-07-17 12:40:38'),
(7191, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 50, 7, 'MELBOURNE – DEPARTURE (MAKAN PAGI)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel, tiba waktunya diantar ke Airport untuk kembali ke Jakarta. Berakhirlah tour yang berkesan ini dan sampai jumpa di tour selanjutnya bersama kami.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 12:40:38', '2026-07-17 12:40:38'),
(7192, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 24, 1, 'Jakarta – Kuala Lumpur – Malaca – Johor Bahru', '<p>Pagi ini kita berkumpul di Bandara Soekarno-Hatta terminal 3 untuk berangkat menuju ke Kuala<br>Lumpur. Setibanya di Kuala Lumpur Anda akan<br>langsung menuju Mallaca untuk mengunjungi Rumah Merah, Christ Church / Gereja Anglican<br>(photo stop) yang dibina pada tahun 1975.<br>Dilanjutkan menuju Famosa (photo stop), benteng<br>yang berarsitektur Eropa tertua di Asia. Kemudian<br>Anda akan berbelanja di Jonker Street (photo stop) dan melanjutkan perjalanan menuju Johor Baru.<br>Check-in hotel dan istirahat.<br>Hotel : Grand Sentosa JB Hotel *3 / Setaraf</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 14:16:02', '2026-07-17 14:16:02'),
(7193, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 24, 2, 'Johor Bahru – Singapore – Kuala Lumpur', '<p>Setelah makan pagi dan check out hotel, Anda akan diantar menuju Singapore dan photo stop di<br>Merlion Park. Kemudian melewati Esplanade dan<br>Singapore Flyer. Dilanjutkan menuju Garden by The Bay untuk photo stop dan Orchard Road untuk photo stop. Selanjutnya Anda akan diantar menuju toko souvenir untuk berbelanja oleh-oleh. Setelah itu Anda akan kembali menuju kota Kuala Lumpur. Setibanya di Kuala Lumpur, Anda akan langsung diantar menuju hotel untuk Check in hotel dan istirahat.<br>Hotel : Kingston Hotel *3 / Setaraf</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 14:16:02', '2026-07-17 14:16:02'),
(7194, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 24, 3, 'Kuala Lumpur – Penanga – Hatyai', '<p>Setelah makan pagi dan check out hotel, Anda akan menuju Istana Negara untuk photostop. Kemudian dilanjutkan menuju Penang dengan melewati Jembatan Penang. Kemudian Anda akan diantar menuju Burmese Temple untuk photo stop yang merupakan kuil tertua di Malaysia. Setelah itu menuju Kek Lok Si Temple untuk photo stop. Sore hari Anda akan menuju ke perbatasan Malaysia – Thailand untuk menuju<br>Hatyai. Check in hotel dan istirahat.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 14:16:02', '2026-07-17 14:16:02'),
(7195, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 24, 4, 'Hatyai', '<p>Setelah makan pagi di hotel, Anda akan menuju<br>Songkhla untuk mengunjungi Pantai Samila dan<br>berfoto di Patung Mermaid. Kemudian Anda akan<br>menuju Patung Budha tidur untuk photo stop yang<br>merupakan salah satu patung terbesar di dunia. Dilanjutkan berbelanja oleh-oleh khas Thailand di<br>Kaysorn, Nora Plaza, Rumah Madu dan juga<br>mengunjungi Floating Market (Khusus Weekend).<br>Setelah makan siang Anda akan diantar kembali ke hotel dan acara bebas. Disini Anda dapat mencoba transportasi Thailand TUK-TUK (biaya pribadi) untuk jalan-jalan dan mencoba berbagai kuliner di Lee Garden Plaza. Setelah itu Anda akan diantar kembali menuju hotel untuk beristirahat.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 14:16:02', '2026-07-17 14:16:02'),
(7196, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 24, 5, 'Hatyai – Kuala Lumpur', '<p>Setelah makan pagi dan check out hotel, Anda akan menuju Kuala Lumpur dengan melewati jalan tol / Highway utara - selatan. Sesampainya di Kuala Lumpur, Anda akan langsung diantar menuju hotel untuk Check-in dan istirahat.<br>Hotel : Pacific Express *3 / Setaraf</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 14:16:02', '2026-07-17 14:16:02'),
(7197, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 24, 6, 'Kuala Lumpur – Batu Caves – Genting Highland', '<p>Setelah makan pagi di hotel, Anda akan menuju<br>Menara Berkembar Petronas untuk photo stop dan Dataran Merdeka untuk photo stop. Kemudian berbelanja di Chocolate Kingdom. Dilanjutkan menuju Batu Cave untuk photo stop. Setelah itu Anda akan diantar menuju Genting Highland dan Genting Premium Outlet dengan menaiki Cable Car untuk naik ke Sky Avenue Genting. Kemudian Anda akan diantar kembal<br>menuju hotel<br>Hotel : Pacific Express *3 / Setaraf</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 14:16:02', '2026-07-17 14:16:02'),
(7198, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 24, 7, 'Kuala Lumpur – Putra Jaya – Jakarta', '<p>Setelah makan pagi di hotel, Anda akan menuju<br>Putrajaya City Tour dan Bridge and Mosque Putra<br>Jaya untuk photo stop. Kemudian Anda akan<br>berbelanja di Mitsui Outlet Park yang terkenal<br>dengan barang Branded dengan harga murah<br>sampai tiba waktunya untuk diantar ke Airport<br>untuk kembali ke Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17 14:16:02', '2026-07-17 14:16:02'),
(7270, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 222, 1, 'Sungailiat', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pick-up at Depati Amir Airport - photo stop at Jembatan Emas (Golden Bridge) - drive to Sungailiat - Puri Tri Agung (a pagoda temple resembling the Temple of Heaven in Beijing) - Tikus Mas Beach - optional tour: Pagoda Nusantara, Matras Beach, Belinyu, otak-otak culinary (optional) - dinner at a local restaurant - drive back to Pangkal Pinang - Taman Merdeka Square - hotel check-in - rest - free time.</p>', 'Hotel sesuai pilihan peserta (Harga Tanpa Hotel/Pia Hotel/Cordella/Santika/Soll Marina/Swiss-Bel/Aston Emidary) - lihat tabel harga pada dokumen price-reference.', 'Makan siang, makan malam', '2026-07-18 02:40:54', '2026-07-18 02:40:54'),
(7271, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 222, 2, 'Koba', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel - Indonesian Tin Museum (closed on Fridays) - Mangrove Forest tourist area (boat ride around the forest) - lunch at a local restaurant - Koba Blue Lake - drive back to Pangkal Pinang city - shopping for Bangka souvenirs - dinner at a local restaurant - transfer to the hotel - rest - free time.</p>', 'Hotel sesuai pilihan peserta (Harga Tanpa Hotel/Pia Hotel/Cordella/Santika/Soll Marina/Swiss-Bel/Aston Emidary) - lihat tabel harga pada dokumen price-reference.', 'Makan pagi, makan siang, makan malam', '2026-07-18 02:40:54', '2026-07-18 02:40:54'),
(7272, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 222, 3, 'City Tour - Bandara', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel - check-out - Zero Point Monument - Bangka Botanical Garden (BBG) - Pasir Padi Beach - enjoy Bangka\'s Mie Koba culinary specialty - transfer to the airport - tour ends.</p>', NULL, 'Makan pagi, kuliner Mie Koba', '2026-07-18 02:40:54', '2026-07-18 02:40:54'),
(7285, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 221, 1, 'Sungailiat', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pick-up at Depati Amir Airport - photo stop at Jembatan Emas (Golden Bridge) - drive to Sungailiat - Puri Tri Agung (a pagoda temple resembling the Temple of Heaven in Beijing) - Tikus Mas Beach - optional tour: Pagoda Nusantara, Matras Beach, Belinyu, otak-otak culinary (optional) - dinner at a local restaurant - drive back to Pangkal Pinang - hotel check-in - rest - free time.</p>', 'Hotel sesuai pilihan peserta (Harga Tanpa Hotel/Pia Hotel/Cordella/Santika/Soll Marina/Swiss-Bel/Aston Emidary) - lihat tabel harga pada dokumen price-reference.', 'Makan siang, makan malam', '2026-07-18 02:46:28', '2026-07-18 02:46:28'),
(7286, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 221, 2, 'Koba', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel - Indonesian Tin Museum (closed on Fridays) - Mangrove Forest tourist area (boat ride around the forest) - lunch at a local restaurant - Koba Blue Lake - drive back to Pangkal Pinang city - dinner at a local restaurant - transfer to the hotel - rest - free time.</p>', 'Hotel sesuai pilihan peserta (Harga Tanpa Hotel/Pia Hotel/Cordella/Santika/Soll Marina/Swiss-Bel/Aston Emidary) - lihat tabel harga pada dokumen price-reference.', 'Makan pagi, makan siang, makan malam', '2026-07-18 02:46:28', '2026-07-18 02:46:28'),
(7287, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 221, 3, 'Bukit Pinteur', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel - Bukit Pinteur - lunch at a local restaurant - drive back to Pangkal Pinang city - shopping for Bangka souvenirs - Taman Merdeka Square - dinner at a local restaurant - transfer to the hotel - rest - free time.</p>', 'Hotel sesuai pilihan peserta (Harga Tanpa Hotel/Pia Hotel/Cordella/Santika/Soll Marina/Swiss-Bel/Aston Emidary) - lihat tabel harga pada dokumen price-reference.', 'Makan pagi, makan siang, makan malam', '2026-07-18 02:46:28', '2026-07-18 02:46:28'),
(7288, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 221, 4, 'City Tour - Bandara', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel - check-out - Zero Point Monument - Bangka Botanical Garden (BBG) - Pasir Padi Beach - enjoy Bangka\'s Mie Koba culinary specialty - transfer to the airport - tour ends.</p>', NULL, 'Makan pagi, kuliner Mie Koba', '2026-07-18 02:46:28', '2026-07-18 02:46:28'),
(7296, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 210, 1, 'Airport - Uluwatu Temple - Jimbaran Beach', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport with a warm flower garland welcome and a traditional Udeng (headtie) or Selendang (sash) souvenir, plus a photo stop at the iconic \'Bali\' sign. Continue to Uluwatu Temple, an 11th-century sanctuary on dramatic sea cliffs, to watch the Kecak fire dance retelling the Ramayana at sunset. The evening closes with a seafood dinner by Jimbaran Beach before hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'Dinner', '2026-07-18 02:56:05', '2026-07-18 02:56:05'),
(7297, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 210, 2, 'Tegenungan Waterfall - Bali Coffee Plantation - Tegalalang', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, then Tegenungan Waterfall for a refreshing swim and photos. Choose between a guided Balinese coffee plantation tour (including Kopi Luwak tasting) or the Bali Swing over lush greenery, followed by a scenic highland stop near Kintamani for volcano and lake views. Lunch at a local restaurant, then an afternoon walks through the Tegalalang Rice Terraces or a purification ritual at Tirta Empul. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 02:56:05', '2026-07-18 02:56:05'),
(7298, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 210, 3, 'Ulun Danu Temple - Bali Handara Gate - Tanah Lot Temple', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Lake Beratan in Bedugul and the picturesque Pura Ulun Danu Beratan, a 17th-century temple dedicated to the water goddess Dewi Danu. Lunch at a local restaurant, a photo stop at the iconic Handara Gate, and sunset at Tanah Lot, Bali\'s celebrated sea temple. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 02:56:05', '2026-07-18 02:56:05'),
(7299, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 210, 4, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel and check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport for departure.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-18 02:56:05', '2026-07-18 02:56:05'),
(7311, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 211, 1, 'Bali Turtle - Kecak Dance - Jimbaran', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport with a flower garland welcome and Udeng/Selendang souvenir. Visit the Bali Turtle Conservation to learn about marine rescue efforts, complete with a conservation certificate as a keepsake. Lunch at a local restaurant, then Uluwatu Temple to watch the Kecak Dance retelling the Ramayana. Dinner by Jimbaran Beach before hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 02:57:47', '2026-07-18 02:57:47'),
(7312, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 211, 2, 'Batik Painting - Monkey Forest - Ubud Centre - Silver & Gold', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a traditional batik painting workshop learning wax-resist techniques from local artisans. Visit the Sacred Monkey Forest Sanctuary in Ubud, lunch at a local restaurant, explore Ubud\'s art markets and palaces, and browse a Silver &amp; Gold gallery to watch master silversmiths at work. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 02:57:47', '2026-07-18 02:57:47'),
(7313, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 211, 3, 'Ulun Danu Temple - Secret Garden - Tanah Lot', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Lake Beratan and Pura Ulun Danu Beratan in Bedugul. Lunch at a local restaurant, followed by a visit to Secret Garden Village for coffee and beauty workshops (or POD Chocolate for a bean-to-bar experience), and sunset at Tanah Lot. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 02:57:47', '2026-07-18 02:57:47'),
(7314, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 211, 4, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel and check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-18 02:57:47', '2026-07-18 02:57:47'),
(7339, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 213, 1, 'Melasti Beach - Kecak Dance - Jimbaran', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival with a flower garland welcome and photo stop at the \'Bali\' sign, then Melasti Beach for its white sand and limestone cliffs. Watch the Kecak Dance at Uluwatu Temple at sunset, followed by dinner by Jimbaran Beach.</p>', NULL, 'Dinner', '2026-07-18 03:24:55', '2026-07-18 03:24:55'),
(7340, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 213, 2, 'Barong Dance - Tegalalang Rice Terrace - Kintamani - Penglipuran', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then the Barong Dance depicting the battle between good and evil. Walk the Tegalalang Rice Terraces, lunch with Mount Batur and Lake Batur views in Kintamani, and visit the bamboo-lined traditional village of Penglipuran. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 03:24:55', '2026-07-18 03:24:55'),
(7341, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 213, 3, 'Nusa Penida - Kelingking - Broken - Angel\'s Billabong - Crystal Bay Beach', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a boat crossing from Sanur to Nusa Penida for Kelingking Beach, Broken Beach, Angel\'s Billabong, and Crystal Bay. Lunch at a local restaurant, return by boat to Sanur. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 03:24:55', '2026-07-18 03:24:55'),
(7342, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 213, 4, 'Ulun Danu Temple - Handara Gate - Wanagiri - Tanah Lot Temple', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Lake Beratan and Pura Ulun Danu Beratan. Lunch at a local restaurant, photo stops at Handara Gate and the Wanagiri Hidden Hills swings, and sunset at Tanah Lot. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-18 03:24:55', '2026-07-18 03:24:55'),
(7343, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 213, 5, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-18 03:24:55', '2026-07-18 03:24:55'),
(7358, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 38, 1, 'ITINERARY', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi, tim kami akan menjemput Anda di hotel di Kota Manado. Perjalanan dilanjutkan menuju Dermaga Serei Likupang dengan menikmati panorama pesisir dan pedesaan khas Sulawesi Utara. Setibanya di dermaga, Anda akan menaiki private boat menuju Pulau Lihaga, sebuah pulau tropis yang terkenal dengan hamparan pasir putih yang lembut, air laut berwarna biru kehijauan, dan suasana yang masih alami.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sesampainya di Pulau Lihaga, nikmati waktu bebas untuk bersantai di pantai, berenang di perairan yang jernih, atau berjalan mengelilingi pulau sambil mengabadikan keindahan alam dari berbagai sudut terbaik. Bagi yang ingin merasakan pengalaman lebih seru, tersedia aktivitas opsional seperti snorkeling, canoeing, maupun diving untuk menikmati keindahan bawah laut yang masih terjaga. Makan siang akan disajikan di pulau sambil menikmati suasana tropis yang tenang.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pada sore hari, perjalanan kembali dengan perahu menuju Dermaga Serei Likupang, kemudian dilanjutkan menuju Kota Manado. Sebelum kembali ke hotel, Anda akan singgah di pusat oleh-oleh khas Manado untuk berbelanja berbagai makanan khas, kerajinan tangan, dan suvenir lokal sebagai kenang-kenangan dari Sulawesi Utara. Setelah selesai berbelanja, Anda akan diantar kembali ke hotel.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>End of Tour</strong></p>', NULL, 'Lunch', '2026-07-20 07:11:41', '2026-07-20 07:11:41'),
(7359, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 18, 1, 'Itinerary', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Participants will be picked up in the morning for a tour to <strong>Mount Mahawu</strong>, located approximately 1 hour and 15 minutes from Manado city. Mount Mahawu is a popular attraction for tourists and hikers visiting Manado. The hiking trail consists of around 150 cemented steps, making the climb relatively easy. Along the way, participants will find metal railings that can be used for support during the ascent. Upon reaching the summit, participants can enjoy stunning panoramic views of Manado Tua Island, Bunaken, and Manado city.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">The tour then continues to <strong>Tetetana Hill</strong> <strong>Peak</strong>, a newly developed tourist destination in Tomohon. In addition to offering panoramic views of four regions across North Sulawesi Province, visitors can also enjoy the beauty of the hill, surrounded by colorful flower gardens.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Afterward, the group will head to a local restaurant for lunch. Following lunch, participants will return to Manado city and be dropped off at the designated pick-up point. End of tour.</p>', NULL, 'Lunch', '2026-07-20 07:12:02', '2026-07-20 07:12:02'),
(7360, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 223, 1, 'Sungailiat', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pick-up at Depati Amir Airport - photo stop at Jembatan Emas (Golden Bridge) - drive to Sungailiat - Puri Tri Agung (a pagoda temple resembling the Temple of Heaven in Beijing) - Tikus Mas Beach - optional tour: Pagoda Nusantara, Matras Beach, Belinyu, otak-otak culinary (optional) - dinner at a local restaurant - drive back to Pangkal Pinang - Taman Merdeka Square - hotel check-in - rest - free time.</p>', 'Hotel sesuai pilihan peserta (Harga Tanpa Hotel/Pia Hotel/Cordella/Santika/Soll Marina/Swiss-Bel/Aston Emidary) - lihat tabel harga pada dokumen price-reference.', 'Makan siang, makan malam', '2026-07-20 08:53:54', '2026-07-20 08:53:54');
INSERT INTO `itineraries` (`id`, `itinerable_type`, `itinerable_id`, `day_number`, `title`, `description`, `hotel_info`, `meals_info`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(7361, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 223, 2, 'City Tour - Bandara', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel - check-out - Zero Point Monument - shopping for Bangka souvenirs - Bangka Botanical Garden (BBG) - Pasir Padi Beach - enjoy Bangka\'s Mie Koba culinary specialty - transfer to the airport - tour ends.</p>', NULL, 'Makan pagi, kuliner Mie Koba', '2026-07-20 08:53:54', '2026-07-20 08:53:54'),
(7428, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 214, 1, 'Airport - Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival with a flower garland welcome and photo stop at the \'Bali\' sign, then a welcome dinner at a local restaurant before hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'D', '2026-07-21 03:52:54', '2026-07-21 03:52:54'),
(7429, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 214, 2, 'Watersport - Melasti Beach - Padang-Padang Beach - Uluwatu Beach', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then watersports at Tanjung Benoa (jet ski, parasailing, banana boat, snorkeling, and more). Lunch with a view, then Melasti Beach, the cave-accessed Padang-Padang Beach made famous by \'Eat Pray Love\', and the rugged cliffs of Uluwatu Beach. Dinner at Jimbaran.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 03:52:54', '2026-07-21 03:52:54'),
(7430, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 214, 3, 'Tegenungan - Bali Swing - Kintamani - Tirta Empul - Ubud Market', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Tegenungan Waterfall and the Bali Swing. Lunch with Mount Batur views in Kintamani, a purification ritual at Tirta Empul, and shopping at Ubud Market. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 03:52:54', '2026-07-21 03:52:54'),
(7431, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 214, 4, 'Ulun Danu Temple - Handara Gate - Wanagiri - Tanah Lot Temple', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Lake Beratan and Pura Ulun Danu Beratan. Lunch at a local restaurant, photo stops at Handara Gate and Wanagiri Hidden Hills, and sunset at Tanah Lot. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 03:52:54', '2026-07-21 03:52:54'),
(7432, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 214, 5, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'B', '2026-07-21 03:52:54', '2026-07-21 03:52:54'),
(7433, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 215, 1, 'Airport', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival with a flower garland welcome and photo stop at the \'Bali\' sign, welcome dinner at a local restaurant, then hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'D', '2026-07-21 03:58:46', '2026-07-21 03:58:46'),
(7434, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 215, 2, 'Watersport - Uluwatu Beach - Jimbaran', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then watersports at Tanjung Benoa, followed by the sea caves and cliffs of Uluwatu Beach. Dinner by Jimbaran Beach.</p>', NULL, 'B/D', '2026-07-21 03:58:46', '2026-07-21 03:58:46'),
(7435, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 215, 3, 'Silver & Batik - ATV/Rafting - Taman Dedari - Ubud', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then silver workshops and batik painting in Celuk, an ATV or rafting adventure, lunch amid the rice-field views of Taman Dedari, and a relaxing Balinese massage at a local spa. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 03:58:46', '2026-07-21 03:58:46'),
(7436, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 215, 4, 'Ulun Danu Temple - Handara Gate - Wanagiri - Tanah Lot Temple', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Lake Beratan and Pura Ulun Danu Beratan. Lunch at a local restaurant, Handara Gate and Wanagiri Hidden Hills, and sunset at Tanah Lot. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 03:58:46', '2026-07-21 03:58:46'),
(7437, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 215, 5, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'B', '2026-07-21 03:58:46', '2026-07-21 03:58:46'),
(7438, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 216, 1, 'Airport - Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival with a flower garland welcome and photo stop at the \'Bali\' sign, welcome dinner at a local restaurant, then hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'D', '2026-07-21 04:00:18', '2026-07-21 04:00:18'),
(7439, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 216, 2, 'Nusa Penida - Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a full-day Nusa Penida trip covering Kelingking Beach\'s T-Rex viewpoint, Angel\'s Billabong natural infinity pool, Diamond Beach, and snorkeling with manta rays. Lunch with a view. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:00:18', '2026-07-21 04:00:18'),
(7440, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 216, 3, 'Silver & Batik - Monkey Forest - Kintamani - Tegalalang', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then silver workshops and batik painting in Celuk, the Sacred Monkey Forest Sanctuary in Ubud, lunch with Mount Batur and Lake Batur views in Kintamani, and a walk through the Tegalalang Rice Terraces. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:00:18', '2026-07-21 04:00:18'),
(7441, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 216, 4, 'Ulun Danu Temple - Handara Gate - Wanagiri - Tanah Lot Temple', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Lake Beratan and Pura Ulun Danu Beratan. Lunch at a local restaurant, Handara Gate and Wanagiri Hidden Hills, and sunset at Tanah Lot. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:00:18', '2026-07-21 04:00:18'),
(7442, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 216, 5, 'Pandawa - Melasti Beach - GWK - Uluwatu Temple - Jimbaran', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then Pandawa Beach or Melasti Beach for turquoise waters and clifftop views. Lunch at a local restaurant, the 120m Garuda Wisnu Kencana cultural park, and Uluwatu Temple. Seafood dinner by Jimbaran Beach.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:00:18', '2026-07-21 04:00:18'),
(7443, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 216, 6, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'B', '2026-07-21 04:00:18', '2026-07-21 04:00:18'),
(7444, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 217, 1, 'Airport - Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival with a flower garland welcome and photo stop at the \'Bali\' sign, welcome dinner at a local restaurant, then hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'D', '2026-07-21 04:01:53', '2026-07-21 04:01:53'),
(7445, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 217, 2, 'Nusa Penida - Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a full-day Nusa Penida trip to Kelingking Beach, Angel\'s Billabong, Diamond Beach, and snorkeling with manta rays. Lunch with a view. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:01:53', '2026-07-21 04:01:53'),
(7446, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 217, 3, 'Silver & Batik - ATV/Rafting - Phinisi Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then silver workshops and batik painting in Celuk, followed by an ATV and rafting adventure. Lunch at a local restaurant, then an elegant Phinisi-style seaside dinner with fresh seafood.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:01:53', '2026-07-21 04:01:53'),
(7447, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 217, 4, 'Rafting/ATV - Kintamani - Volcano Jeep Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, more ATV/rafting adventure, lunch with Mount Batur views in Kintamani, and an off-road Volcano Jeep Tour through Bali\'s volcanic terrain. Dinner featuring fresh local cuisine.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:01:53', '2026-07-21 04:01:53'),
(7448, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 217, 5, 'Watersport - Uluwatu Temple - Jimbaran', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, watersports at Tanjung Benoa, lunch with a view, Uluwatu Temple\'s clifftop setting and Kecak Dance, and an iconic seafood dinner on Jimbaran Beach.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:01:53', '2026-07-21 04:01:53'),
(7449, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 217, 6, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'B', '2026-07-21 04:01:53', '2026-07-21 04:01:53'),
(7450, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 218, 1, 'Airport - Kecak Dance - Seafood Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival at Ngurah Rai International Airport with a flower garland welcome and Udeng/Selendang souvenir. Evening Kecak Dance performance, then a seafood dinner in Jimbaran.</p>', NULL, 'D', '2026-07-21 04:03:28', '2026-07-21 04:03:28'),
(7451, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 218, 2, 'ATV/Rafting - Penglipuran Village - Alas Arum - Silver & Batik', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then an ATV or rafting adventure amid rivers and rice fields. Lunch, then the bamboo-lined Penglipuran Village, photo stops at Alas Arum, and a Silver &amp; Gold and batik handicraft shopping stop. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:03:28', '2026-07-21 04:03:28'),
(7452, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 218, 3, 'Gili Trawangan - Lunch - Cidomo Ride - Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to the harbor and boat crossing to Gili Trawangan. Lunch on arrival, a cidomo (traditional horse-cart) ride around the island, hotel check-in, and dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:03:28', '2026-07-21 04:03:28'),
(7453, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 218, 4, 'Breakfast - Snorkeling - Lunch - Dinner - Cidomo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Morning snorkeling among Gili Trawangan\'s colorful marine life, lunch at a local restaurant, free time to relax, a cidomo ride, and dinner at the hotel.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:03:28', '2026-07-21 04:03:28'),
(7454, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 218, 5, 'Return to Bali', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Boat transfer back from Gili Trawangan to Bali, hotel check-in and rest. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/D', '2026-07-21 04:03:28', '2026-07-21 04:03:28'),
(7455, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 218, 6, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'B', '2026-07-21 04:03:28', '2026-07-21 04:03:28'),
(7456, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 219, 1, 'Airport', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival at Ngurah Rai International Airport with a traditional flower garland welcome and Udeng/Selendang souvenir, then free time before hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-21 04:06:54', '2026-07-21 04:06:54'),
(7457, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 219, 2, 'Go to Lovina - Check in Hotel - Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a scenic drive north to Lovina through rural villages and rice fields, with lunch at a local restaurant en route. Hotel check-in in Lovina, dinner at the hotel.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:06:54', '2026-07-21 04:06:54'),
(7458, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 219, 3, 'Dolphin Show - Ulun Danu Temple - Tanah Lot Temple', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">An early-morning dolphin-watching boat trip in Lovina, lunch at a local restaurant, then Pura Ulun Danu Beratan in Bedugul and sunset at Tanah Lot. Dinner at a local restaurant, then transfer back to the Legian area for hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:06:54', '2026-07-21 04:06:54'),
(7459, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 219, 4, 'Batik Handcraft - Silver & Gold Jewelry - Kintamani - Tirta Empul/Tegenungan', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a Silver &amp; Gold and batik handicraft gallery visit, lunch with Mount Batur views in Kintamani, and an afternoon at Tirta Empul sacred spring temple or Tegenungan Waterfall. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:06:54', '2026-07-21 04:06:54'),
(7460, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 219, 5, 'Turtle Conservation - Uluwatu Temple - Lunch & Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a visit to the Turtle Conservation Center with a certificate of participation, lunch at a local restaurant, and Uluwatu Temple\'s clifftop views. Dinner at the hotel.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:06:54', '2026-07-21 04:06:54'),
(7461, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 219, 6, 'Bali Offering - Taman Dedari Lunch - Batuan Temple', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a Canang Sari (traditional daily offering) making activity, lunch at Taman Dedari\'s riverside setting, and a visit to the historic Pura Batuan temple. Dinner at the hotel.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:06:54', '2026-07-21 04:06:54'),
(7462, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 219, 7, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, optional shopping at a mall if time permits, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'B', '2026-07-21 04:06:54', '2026-07-21 04:06:54'),
(7463, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 220, 1, 'Airport', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival at Ngurah Rai International Airport with a traditional flower garland welcome and Udeng/Selendang souvenir, then free time before hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-21 04:08:27', '2026-07-21 04:08:27'),
(7464, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 220, 2, 'Nusa Penida - Kelingking - Broken - Angel\'s Billabong - Crystal Bay Beach', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a full-day Nusa Penida trip covering Kelingking Beach, Broken Beach, Angel\'s Billabong, and Crystal Bay. Lunch with a view. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:08:27', '2026-07-21 04:08:27'),
(7465, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 220, 3, 'Batik Handcraft, Silver & Gold Jewelry, Bali Zoo/Bali Safari Park', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a Silver &amp; Gold and batik handicraft gallery visit, followed by Bali Zoo or Bali Safari Park for an interactive wildlife experience. Lunch and dinner at local restaurants.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:08:27', '2026-07-21 04:08:27'),
(7466, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 220, 4, 'Kintamani, Tirta Empul or Tegenungan Waterfall', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a scenic drive to Kintamani for Mount Batur and Lake Batur views, lunch at a local restaurant, and an afternoon at Tirta Empul sacred spring temple or Tegenungan Waterfall. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:08:27', '2026-07-21 04:08:27'),
(7467, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 220, 5, 'Banana Boat - Uluwatu Temple - Seafood Dinner', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a banana boat ride along the coastline, lunch at a local restaurant, Uluwatu Temple\'s clifftop views, and a seafood dinner by the sea.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:08:27', '2026-07-21 04:08:27'),
(7468, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 220, 6, 'Bali Swing - Goa Gajah - Krisna Souvenir Shop', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then the Bali Swing over jungle and river-valley views, a visit to Goa Gajah (Elephant Cave), lunch featuring a local Balinese duck dish, and souvenir shopping at Krisna Oleh-Oleh. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'B/L/D', '2026-07-21 04:08:27', '2026-07-21 04:08:27'),
(7469, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 220, 7, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, check-out, optional visit to Icon Mall/Beachwalk if time permits, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport in the evening.</p>', NULL, 'B', '2026-07-21 04:08:27', '2026-07-21 04:08:27'),
(7470, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 212, 1, 'Airport - Uluwatu Temple - Jimbaran Beach', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival at Ngurah Rai International Airport with a traditional flower garland welcome and Udeng/Selendang souvenir. Continue to Uluwatu to watch the Kecak Dance, a retelling of the Ramayana epic. Dinner by Jimbaran Beach before hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, 'Dinner', '2026-07-21 04:08:58', '2026-07-21 04:08:58'),
(7471, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 212, 2, 'Nusa Penida - Kelingking - Broken - Angel\'s Billabong - Crystal Bay Beach', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then a boat crossing from Sanur to Nusa Penida for a full day exploring the famous Kelingking Beach viewpoint, Broken Beach, the natural infinity pool of Angel\'s Billabong, and Crystal Bay\'s clear waters for swimming or snorkeling. Lunch at a local restaurant, then return by boat to Sanur. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-21 04:08:58', '2026-07-21 04:08:58'),
(7472, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 212, 3, 'ATV/Rafting - Bali Swing - Silver & Gold', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then an adrenaline-filled ATV or white-water rafting adventure through jungles and rivers. Lunch at a local restaurant, a stop near Kintamani for volcano views, the Bali Swing over lush greenery, and a Silver &amp; Gold gallery visit. Dinner at a local restaurant.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-21 04:08:58', '2026-07-21 04:08:58'),
(7473, 'App\\Models\\IndonesiaDestination', 212, 4, 'Airport - Tour Done', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel and check-out, then transfer to Ngurah Rai Airport.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-21 04:08:58', '2026-07-21 04:08:58'),
(7474, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 37, 1, 'ARRIVAL MANADO', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setibanya di Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado, Anda akan disambut oleh tim kami dan diantar menuju hotel atau resort pilihan untuk proses check-in.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sisa hari dapat digunakan untuk beristirahat setelah perjalanan, menikmati fasilitas resort, atau bersantai sambil menikmati suasana tropis Sulawesi Utara. Bagi tamu yang menginap di Pulau Bunaken, perjalanan akan dilanjutkan dengan boat transfer menuju resort sebelum waktu bebas untuk menikmati keindahan pulau dan laut sekitarnya.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menginap di hotel atau resort pilihan.</p>', NULL, 'Dinner', '2026-07-21 08:57:31', '2026-07-21 08:57:31'),
(7475, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 37, 2, 'BUNAKEN DIVING EXPERIENCE', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi, petualangan diving dimulai dengan menjelajahi beberapa dive site terbaik di Taman Laut Bunaken. Kawasan ini terkenal dengan dinding karang vertikal yang spektakuler, taman karang berwarna-warni, serta keanekaragaman hayati laut yang luar biasa.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Selama penyelaman, Anda berkesempatan melihat penyu hijau dan penyu sisik yang sering beristirahat di dinding karang, berbagai spesies ikan tropis, hingga predator laut seperti barracuda dan reef shark yang sesekali melintas. Setelah menyelesaikan program diving dan makan siang, kembali ke resort untuk menikmati waktu santai di tepi pantai atau fasilitas resort.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-21 08:57:31', '2026-07-21 08:57:31'),
(7476, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 37, 3, 'DISCOVER MORE OF BUNAKEN\'S UNDERWATER PARADISEe', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan pagi sebelum melanjutkan eksplorasi bawah laut Bunaken. Hari ini Anda akan mengunjungi dive site lainnya yang menawarkan karakter berbeda, mulai dari coral garden yang luas, lereng karang yang indah, hingga dinding laut dalam yang menjadi ciri khas Bunaken Marine Park.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Selain biota laut berukuran besar, Bunaken juga menjadi rumah bagi berbagai makhluk kecil yang menarik seperti nudibranch, lionfish, seahorse, shrimp, dan scorpion fish yang bersembunyi di antara terumbu karang. Setelah aktivitas diving selesai, kembali ke resort dan nikmati waktu bebas untuk bersantai sambil menikmati suasana pulau yang damai.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner', '2026-07-21 08:57:31', '2026-07-21 08:57:31'),
(7477, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 37, 4, 'DEPARTURE MANADO', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi dan proses check-out, Anda akan dijemput dari hotel atau resort untuk transfer menuju Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado sesuai jadwal penerbangan. Untuk tamu yang menginap di Pulau Bunaken, perjalanan diawali dengan boat transfer menuju daratan utama Manado sebelum melanjutkan perjalanan ke bandara.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>End of Program</strong></p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-21 08:57:31', '2026-07-21 08:57:31'),
(7478, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 31, 1, 'ARRIVAL MANADO - PARADISE GOLF RESORT', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setibanya di Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado atau lokasi penjemputan yang telah ditentukan, Anda akan disambut oleh tim kami dan diantar menuju Paradise Hotel &amp; Golf Resort yang terletak di pesisir Sulawesi Utara. Perjalanan menuju resort memakan waktu sekitar 60–90 menit dengan pemandangan alam yang hijau dan suasana pedesaan yang tenang.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sesampainya di resort, proses check-in dilakukan dan Anda dapat menikmati waktu bebas untuk beristirahat atau menjelajahi area resort. Nikmati suasana santai, pemandangan lapangan golf yang indah, serta udara segar khas tepi laut yang menjadikan resort ini tempat yang ideal untuk melepas penat dari rutinitas sehari-hari.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menginap di Paradise Hotel &amp; Golf Resort.</p>', NULL, 'No Meals', '2026-07-21 08:58:13', '2026-07-21 08:58:13'),
(7479, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 31, 2, 'PARADISE GOLF EXPERIENCE (18 HOLES)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi di hotel, saatnya menikmati pengalaman bermain golf di Paradise Golf Course. Lapangan golf ini menawarkan kombinasi fairway yang menantang dengan panorama alam tropis yang memukau, menciptakan pengalaman bermain yang menyenangkan bagi golfer pemula maupun berpengalaman.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Permainan 18 holes telah termasuk green fee, golf cart, dan caddy sehingga Anda dapat menikmati permainan dengan nyaman. Setelah menyelesaikan ronde golf, waktu bebas dapat digunakan untuk bersantai di resort, menikmati fasilitas hotel, atau mengikuti aktivitas opsional seperti snorkeling maupun glass bottom boat yang tersedia di area resort.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menjelang sore hari, nikmati suasana resort yang tenang sambil menikmati pemandangan matahari terbenam di kawasan pesisir Sulawesi Utara.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Menginap di Paradise Hotel &amp; Golf Resort.</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-21 08:58:13', '2026-07-21 08:58:13'),
(7480, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 31, 3, 'DEPARTURE MANADO', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan pagi di hotel, nikmati waktu santai sebelum proses check-out. Anda masih memiliki kesempatan untuk menikmati suasana resort atau berfoto di area sekitar sebelum keberangkatan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pada waktu yang telah ditentukan, tim kami akan mengantar Anda menuju Bandara Internasional Sam Ratulangi Manado atau lokasi tujuan di Kota Manado untuk melanjutkan perjalanan berikutnya.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Dengan berakhirnya program ini, semoga pengalaman bermain golf dan menikmati suasana tropis Sulawesi Utara menjadi kenangan yang menyenangkan dan berkesan.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>End of Program</strong></p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-21 08:58:13', '2026-07-21 08:58:13'),
(7481, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 23, 1, 'ARRIVAL – Explore TUNAN WATERFALL', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival at Manado in the morning. Meet our guide, then proceed to the picked up to go to&nbsp;<strong>Tunan Waterfall</strong>, this waterfall is in&nbsp;<strong>Talawan Village</strong>. The source of the&nbsp;<strong>Tunan Waterfall</strong>&nbsp;comes from the river above the mountain which flows quite rapidly through steep cliffs with a cliff height of approximately 86 meters. The atmosphere of the natural forest that is still pristine and natural adds to the beauty around the&nbsp;<strong>Tunan Waterfall</strong>&nbsp;Nature Tourism object.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;We drive right to&nbsp;<strong>Tangkoko National Park</strong>&nbsp;<i>(if you arrive in the afternoon, skip the Tunan Waterfall trip and go straight to Batu Putih village in Tangkoko)</i>. At the end of the afternoon, a short hike in the forest in search of the big star of the park: the Tarsier Spectrum, the smallest mammal on the planet. Tangkoko Sanctuary Villa is where you will spend the night.</p>', NULL, 'Dinner', '2026-07-21 08:58:35', '2026-07-21 08:58:35'),
(7482, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 23, 2, 'FULL DAY TANGKOKO TOUR', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After finishing breakfast at the homestay, start to explore the endemic species of North Sulawesi at the Tangkoko Nature Reserve. Search for the Black Crested Macaque (Black Monkey indigenous to North Sulawesi), another Tarsier Spectrum (the world’s smallest primate), Cuscus bear, and lots of birds. The national park is home to the world\'s highest population of hornbills, including the rhinoceros hornbill.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After lunch we\'ll go on another excursion into Tangkoko\'s jungle in the afternoon. Overnight at homestay.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast / Lunch / Dinner', '2026-07-21 08:58:35', '2026-07-21 08:58:35'),
(7483, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 23, 3, 'WARUGA SAWANGAN – MINAHASA HIGHLAND TOUR', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast, check out and drive to the highlands, then proceed to the&nbsp;<strong>Waruga Sawangan</strong>, with a halt at the ancient Minahasa People\'s Tomb (Giant Stone Ages). Having lunch at&nbsp;<strong>Tondano Lake</strong>. Proceed to Tomohon to see the&nbsp;<strong>traditional market</strong>, after that&nbsp;<strong>Woloan Village</strong>&nbsp;knock-down wooden house industry (locals here create exquisite Minahasa-style wooden homes that are disassembled and shipped out of their village), and&nbsp;<strong>Kai’santi Tomohon</strong>&nbsp;which is a photo stop with a scenic backdrop of Mt. Lokon &amp; green rice fields.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">We spend the afternoon at&nbsp;<strong>Linow Lake</strong>&nbsp;drinking coffee or tea. check in to your room in a resort in Tomohon.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-21 08:58:35', '2026-07-21 08:58:35'),
(7484, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 23, 4, 'Mt. MAHAWU TREKKING – BUNAKEN ISLAND', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast at the hotel, check-out. Meet our guide, then proceed to the&nbsp;<strong>Mt. Mahawu crater</strong>. After a 10-minute hike to the crater\'s rim, you\'ll be rewarded with a breathtaking view of Tomohon and Manado, as well as the islands beyond, at the crater\'s bottom, visitors can see a steaming lake and smell sulfur from the pools. After lunch, transfer by boat to the island of Bunaken (approximately 45 minutes by boat).&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Bunaken Marine Park</strong>&nbsp;is a marine park in North Sulawesi, Indonesia, east of Bunaken Island. This marine park is well-known for its breathtaking underwater scenery. Bunaken Marine Park, with an area of roughly 89,065 hectares, is a popular destination for divers and snorkelers from all over the world. Lodging will be provided at Resorts on Bunaken Island&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast / Dinner', '2026-07-21 08:58:35', '2026-07-21 08:58:35'),
(7485, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 23, 5, 'BUNAKEN ISLAND (SWIMMING / SNORKELING)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">We freely enjoy the pleasures of the sea in one of Indonesia\'s most gorgeous snorkeling sites. We\'re in the midst of a magnificent ecosystem with over 500 coral types and approximately 1,500 fish species, harmless reef sharks, and Turtles are frequently spotted surrounding the island.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Note:</strong> <i>as an option, it is possible to rent snorkeling equipment and do it from the beach or book a boat trip. Diving outings are also possible (reservation and payment on site)&nbsp;</i></p>', NULL, 'Breakfast / Lunch / Dinner', '2026-07-21 08:58:35', '2026-07-21 08:58:35'),
(7486, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 23, 6, 'TRANSFER OUT TO AIRPORT', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">After breakfast at the hotel, check-out. Transfer by boat to Manado, Next, you will be escorted by our tour guide to the airport for transfer out. Tour is over, Thank you.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-07-21 08:58:35', '2026-07-21 08:58:35'),
(7487, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 118, 1, 'Jakarta - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Hong Kong with Garuda Indonesia GA860 (23.50-05.45). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:27:54', '2026-07-22 08:27:54'),
(7488, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 118, 2, 'Hongkong - Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Victoria Peak (top level), Golden Bauhinia Square, the Avenue of Stars, the TST Clock Tower, shop at a souvenir shop, then continue to Shenzhen. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:27:54', '2026-07-22 08:27:54'),
(7489, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 118, 3, 'Shenzhen - Guangzhou', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit a jade shop, a herbs shop, a photo stop at the Civic Center, Melania Town, Haixinsha Square Asian Games Park, and Huacheng Square. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:27:54', '2026-07-22 08:27:54'),
(7490, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 118, 4, 'Guangzhou - Foshan - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Yuexiu Park, the Ancestral Temple, the Huang Fei Hong Memorial Hall, the Grand Arch, and Fengjian Water Town, then continue to Zhuhai. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:27:54', '2026-07-22 08:27:54'),
(7491, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 118, 5, 'Zhuhai - Macau - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the Fishing Girl Statue, Zhuhai Lovers Road, shop at a silk shop and a latex shop/bamboo shop, then continue to Macau visiting Senado Square, the Ruins of St. Paul, a souvenir shop, and the Venetian Shopping Arcade. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:27:54', '2026-07-22 08:27:54'),
(7492, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 118, 6, 'Zhuhai - Hongkong', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to Hong Kong via the HZM Bridge with a golden shuttle bus, enjoying a full day at Hong Kong Disneyland (entrance ticket included). Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:27:54', '2026-07-22 08:27:54'),
(7493, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 118, 7, 'Hongkong - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to Hong Kong International Airport for the flight back to Jakarta GA863 (09.30-13.15).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:27:54', '2026-07-22 08:27:54'),
(7494, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 117, 1, 'Jakarta - Hongkong - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Depart for Hong Kong (CGK-KUL MH710, KUL-HKG MH078). Continue to Zhuhai by golden public bus via the HZM Bridge. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:35:45', '2026-07-22 08:35:45'),
(7495, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 117, 2, 'Zhuhai - Macau - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the Fisher Girl Statue, Lovers\' Road, the Zhuhai Opera House, then continue to Macau visiting Senado Square, the Ruins of St. Paul, a souvenir shop, The Londoner, The Parisian, and the Venetian Complex. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:35:45', '2026-07-22 08:35:45'),
(7496, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 117, 3, 'Zhuhai - Guangzhou', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shop at a silk shop and a bamboo shop, continue to Guangzhou visiting Huacheng Square, ride the Young Tram, view Canton Tower from a distance, Dafo Temple, and free time on Beijing Road. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:35:45', '2026-07-22 08:35:45'),
(7497, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 117, 4, 'Guangzhou - Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Ersha Island, Lychee Bay, Pan Tang Ancient Village, Xiguan Mansion, Yong Qing Fang, and the Bruce Lee House before continuing to Shenzhen. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:35:45', '2026-07-22 08:35:45'),
(7498, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 117, 5, 'Shenzhen City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shenzhen city tour with a photo stop at the Civic Center, shopping at a jade shop and a herbal shop, visiting OH Bay, Talent Park, Shenzhen Bay Cultural Square, and free time at Mixc Mall. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:35:45', '2026-07-22 08:35:45'),
(7499, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 117, 6, 'Shenzhen - Hong Kong Disneyland', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to Hong Kong visiting Golden Bauhinia Square and the Avenue of Stars, a photo stop at 1881 Heritage, shopping at a chocolate &amp; jewellery shop, then continue to Hong Kong Disneyland (entrance ticket included). Overnight at a 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:35:45', '2026-07-22 08:35:45'),
(7500, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 117, 7, 'Hongkong - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to Hong Kong International Airport for the flight back to Jakarta (HKG-KUL MH79, KUL-CGK MH723).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:35:45', '2026-07-22 08:35:45'),
(7501, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 116, 1, 'Jakarta - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta International Airport for the flight to Hong Kong GA860 (23.50-05.45, +1 day). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:41:32', '2026-07-22 08:41:32'),
(7502, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 116, 2, 'Hongkong - Macau - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">City tour visiting Victoria Peak (top level), the Avenue of Stars, a photo stop at 1881 Heritage and the Clock Tower, then continue to Macau visiting the Ruins of St. Paul, The Venetian Resort, and the Diamond Show at Galaxy Macau, then head to Zhuhai. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:41:32', '2026-07-22 08:41:32'),
(7503, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 116, 3, 'Zhuhai - Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Zhuhai city tour visiting the Fisher Girl Statue, Lovers Road, the Zhuhai Opera House, a silk shop, a latex shop, and free time at Fuhuali Walking Street, then continue to Shenzhen. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:41:32', '2026-07-22 08:41:32'),
(7504, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 116, 4, 'Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit a jade shop and a herbs shop, a photo stop at the Civic Center and the Ping An Finance Center, Nantou Ancient Town, OH Bay (Ferris Wheel excluded), and free shopping at Coco Park. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:41:32', '2026-07-22 08:41:32'),
(7505, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 116, 5, 'Shenzhen - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check out and transfer to Hong Kong International Airport by golden shuttle bus for the flight back to Jakarta GA863 (09.40-13.25).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:41:32', '2026-07-22 08:41:32'),
(7506, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 115, 1, 'Jakarta - Hongkong - Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Depart for Hong Kong (CGK-KUL MH726, KUL-HKG MH72). Visit Victoria Peak, Golden Bauhinia Square, the Avenue of Stars, and the TST Clock Tower, then continue to Shenzhen. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:47:47', '2026-07-22 08:47:47'),
(7507, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 115, 2, 'Shenzhen - Guangzhou', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit a jade shop, a herbs shop, a photo stop at the Civic Center, Melania Town, Haixinsha Square Asian Games Park, and Huacheng Square. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:47:47', '2026-07-22 08:47:47'),
(7508, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 115, 3, 'Guangzhou - Foshan - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Yuexiu Park, the Ancestral Temple, the Huang Fei Hong Memorial Hall, the Grand Arch, and Fengjian Water Town, then continue to Zhuhai. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:47:47', '2026-07-22 08:47:47'),
(7509, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 115, 4, 'Zhuhai - Macau - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the Fishing Girl Statue, Zhuhai Lovers Road, shop at a silk shop and a latex shop, then continue to Macau visiting Senado Square, the Ruins of St. Paul, and the Venetian Shopping Arcade. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:47:47', '2026-07-22 08:47:47'),
(7510, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 115, 5, 'Zhuhai - Hongkong - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey back to Hong Kong International Airport via the HZM Bridge with a golden shuttle bus for the flight back to Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:47:47', '2026-07-22 08:47:47'),
(7511, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 114, 1, 'Jakarta - Hongkong - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Depart for Hong Kong (CGK-KUL MH726, KUL-HKG MH72). City orientation to the Avenue of Stars, 1881 Heritage, and the Clock Tower, shop at a souvenir shop, then continue to Zhuhai via the HZMB with a public golden bus. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:52:24', '2026-07-22 08:52:24'),
(7512, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 114, 2, 'Zhuhai - Macau Day Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Full-day Macau tour visiting the Ruins of St. Paul, A-Ma Temple, Senado Square, The Venetian Resort, a photo stop at Macau Tower, and Fisherman\'s Wharf. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:52:24', '2026-07-22 08:52:24'),
(7513, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 114, 3, 'Zhuhai - Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Zhuhai city tour visiting the Fisher Girl Statue, Lovers Road, the Zhuhai Opera House, a silk shop &amp; bamboo shop, then continue to Shenzhen visiting a modern bookstore and the OH Bay lifestyle district (Ferris Wheel not included). Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:52:24', '2026-07-22 08:52:24'),
(7514, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 114, 4, 'Shenzhen City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Photo stop at the Civic Center, visiting a jade shop and a herbs shop, Lotus Park, the Diwang Building, and free time at Dongmen Walking Street. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:52:24', '2026-07-22 08:52:24'),
(7515, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 114, 5, 'Shenzhen - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Flight back to Jakarta via Kuala Lumpur transit (SZX-KUL MH523, KUL-CGK MH711 or MH717).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:52:24', '2026-07-22 08:52:24'),
(7516, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 113, 1, 'Jakarta - Hongkong - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Depart for Hong Kong with Malaysia Airlines (CGK-KUL MH726, KUL-HKG MH072). Visit the Avenue of Stars, 1881 Heritage, shop at a chocolate &amp; jewellery shop, then continue to Zhuhai via the HZM Bridge. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:57:22', '2026-07-22 08:57:22'),
(7517, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 113, 2, 'Zhuhai - Macau - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the Fisher Girl Statue, Lovers\' Road, the Zhuhai Opera House, then continue to Macau visiting Senado Square, the Ruins of St. Paul, The Londoner, The Parisian, and the Venetian Complex. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:57:22', '2026-07-22 08:57:22'),
(7518, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 113, 3, 'Zhuhai - Guangzhou', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shop at a silk shop and a bamboo shop, continue to Guangzhou visiting Huacheng Square, ride the Young Tram, view Canton Tower from a distance, Dafo Temple, and free time on Beijing Road. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:57:22', '2026-07-22 08:57:22'),
(7519, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 113, 4, 'Guangzhou - Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Ersha Island, Lychee Bay, Pan Tang Ancient Village, Xiguan Mansion, Yongqingfang, and the Bruce Lee House before continuing to Shenzhen. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:57:22', '2026-07-22 08:57:22'),
(7520, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 113, 5, 'Shenzhen City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shenzhen city tour with a photo stop at the Civic Center, shopping at a jade shop and a herbal shop, visiting OH Bay, Talent Park, Shenzhen Bay Cultural Square, and free time at Mixc Mall. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:57:22', '2026-07-22 08:57:22'),
(7521, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 113, 6, 'Shenzhen - Hong Kong Disneyland', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to Hong Kong and spend the full day at Hong Kong Disneyland (entrance ticket included). Overnight at a 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:57:22', '2026-07-22 08:57:22'),
(7522, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 113, 7, 'Hongkong - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to Hong Kong International Airport for the flight back to Jakarta (HKG-KUL MH79, KUL-CGK MH723).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 08:57:22', '2026-07-22 08:57:22'),
(7523, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 112, 1, 'Jakarta - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Hong Kong with Garuda Indonesia GA860 (23.50-05.45). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:03:52', '2026-07-22 09:03:52'),
(7524, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 112, 2, 'Hongkong - Shenzhen', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit Victoria Peak (top level), Golden Bauhinia Square, Avenue of Stars, the TST Clock Tower, and shop at a jewellery &amp; chocolate shop. Continue to Shenzhen. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:03:52', '2026-07-22 09:03:52'),
(7525, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 112, 3, 'Shenzhen - Guangzhou', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit a jade shop, a herbs shop, a photo stop at the Civic Center, Melania Town, Haixinsha Square Asian Games Park, and Huacheng Square. Continue to Guangzhou. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:03:52', '2026-07-22 09:03:52'),
(7526, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 112, 4, 'Guangzhou - Foshan - Zhuhai', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Yuexiu Park, the Ancestral Temple, the Huang Fei Hong Memorial Hall in Foshan, and shop at a silk shop in Zhuhai. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:03:52', '2026-07-22 09:03:52'),
(7527, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 112, 5, 'Zhuhai - Hong Kong Disneyland', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to Hong Kong via the HZM Bridge with a golden shuttle bus. Enjoy a full day at Hong Kong Disneyland, entrance ticket and round-trip transportation included. Overnight at a local 4-star or 3-star (or similar) hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:03:52', '2026-07-22 09:03:52'),
(7528, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 112, 6, 'Hongkong - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to Hong Kong International Airport for the flight back to Jakarta with GA863 (09.30-13.15).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:03:52', '2026-07-22 09:03:52'),
(7529, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 119, 1, 'Jakarta - Taoyuan', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Taipei with EVA Airways (Premium Airlines). Arrive at Taoyuan Airport, welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit Taoyuan city before checking in at the hotel (Century Hotel Taoyuan or similar).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:15:24', '2026-07-22 09:15:24'),
(7530, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 119, 2, 'Taoyuan - Sun Moon Lake - Taichung (BL)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Head to Sun Moon Lake (748m above sea level), Taiwan\'s only large natural lake, enjoying a boat cruise and cycling along the lakeside trail. Visit Ita Thao Village for Thao indigenous culture, and the Lingzhi Centre. In the evening, visit Fengjia Night Market in Taichung. Overnight at Holiday Inn Express Taichung Fengchia or similar.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:15:24', '2026-07-22 09:15:24'),
(7531, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 119, 3, 'Taichung - Taipei (BL)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Head to Taipei, visiting Yehliu with its natural rock formations, the mountain village of Jiufen, a tea shop to sample Taiwanese specialty tea, and Shifen to release a wish lantern (Sky Lantern Release), ending with shopping at a Duty Free Shop. Overnight at Hotel Papa Whale or similar.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:15:24', '2026-07-22 09:15:24'),
(7532, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 119, 4, 'Taipei (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">A free day to explore Taipei independently, without bus or guide. Overnight at Hotel Papa Whale or similar.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:15:24', '2026-07-22 09:15:24'),
(7533, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 119, 5, 'Taoyuan - Jakarta (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:15:24', '2026-07-22 09:15:24'),
(7534, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 1, 'Jakarta - Sydney', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Departure from Jakarta to Sydney with Garuda Indonesia GA-712 (23.55-09.45). Meal on board, overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7535, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 2, 'Sydney City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Enjoy Sydney with photos at the Opera House, visiting The Rocks &amp; Circular Quay, Mrs. Macquarie\'s Chair, and the Darling Harbour atmosphere.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7536, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 3, 'Blue Mountain', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to the Blue Mountains, enjoying the views of Echo Point &amp; the Three Sisters, riding the Scenic World Ultimate Discovery Pass, followed by shopping at DFO Homebush.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7537, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 4, 'Sydney - Gold Coast', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Domestic flight to Gold Coast. Visit HOTA (Home of the Arts), Burleigh Beach, Narrowneck, Southport Yacht Club, and Marina Mirage/Pacific Fair.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7538, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 5, 'Movie World Gold Coast', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">A full day of fun at Warner Bros. Movie World Gold Coast, entrance ticket included.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7539, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 6, 'Gold Coast - Melbourne', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Domestic flight to Melbourne. Visit Parliament House, St Patrick\'s Cathedral, Captain Cook\'s Cottage, the MCG, Rod Laver Arena, the Royal Botanic Gardens, the Shrine of Remembrance, the National Gallery of Victoria, the Victorian Arts Centre, Federation Square, and Flinders Street Station.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7540, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 7, 'Ballarat Wildlife Park & Sovereign Hill', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Journey to Ballarat, visiting Ballarat Wildlife Park and Sovereign Hill, a historic district from Australia\'s gold-rush era.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7541, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 8, 'Melbourne Free Day', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Free day in Melbourne, without guide or transportation.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7542, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 120, 9, 'Melbourne - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Flight back to Jakarta with Garuda Indonesia GA-717 (15.30-19.45).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22 09:41:53', '2026-07-22 09:41:53'),
(7543, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 125, 1, 'Jakarta - Incheon', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Incheon with a premium airline. Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:12:53', '2026-07-23 02:12:53'),
(7544, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 125, 2, 'Incheon - Nami Island - Seoul', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Incheon, welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit Nami Island (filming location of \'Winter Sonata\'), then Gangnam COEX Mall with the Starfield Library and the Gangnam Style Statue. Check in at a 3-star (or similar) hotel/condotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:12:53', '2026-07-23 02:12:53');
INSERT INTO `itineraries` (`id`, `itinerable_type`, `itinerable_id`, `day_number`, `title`, `description`, `hotel_info`, `meals_info`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(7545, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 125, 3, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Gyeongbokgung Palace &amp; the National Folklore Museum, passing the Blue House, Itaewon Mosque, and Noksapyeong Street, make kimbap and wear hanbok, visit Namsan Seoul Tower with the Love &amp; Lock padlocks, and shop at Dongdaemun.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:12:53', '2026-07-23 02:12:53'),
(7546, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 125, 4, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the National Ginseng Museum, a healthcare shop (Red Pine Tree), Café Pokpo (the viral waterfall café, drinks not included), a duty-free shop, a K-cosmetics shop, and shop at Myeongdong Street.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:12:53', '2026-07-23 02:12:53'),
(7547, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 125, 5, 'Seoul - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Free time in the morning, visiting a local supermarket for last-minute souvenirs, then transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:12:53', '2026-07-23 02:12:53'),
(7548, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 126, 1, 'Jakarta - Incheon', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Incheon with a premium airline. Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:17:16', '2026-07-23 02:17:16'),
(7549, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 126, 2, 'Incheon - Nami Island - Seoul', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Incheon, welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit Nami Island (filming location of \'Winter Sonata\'), then Gangnam COEX Mall with the Starfield Library and the Gangnam Style Statue. Check in at a 3-star (or similar) hotel/condotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:17:16', '2026-07-23 02:17:16'),
(7550, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 126, 3, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Gyeongbokgung Palace &amp; the National Folklore Museum, passing the Blue House, Itaewon Mosque, and Noksapyeong Street, make kimbap and wear hanbok, visit Namsan Seoul Tower with the Love &amp; Lock padlocks, and shop at Dongdaemun.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:17:16', '2026-07-23 02:17:16'),
(7551, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 126, 4, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the National Ginseng Museum, a healthcare shop (Red Pine Tree), Café Pokpo (the viral waterfall café, drinks not included), a duty-free shop, a K-cosmetics shop, and shop at Myeongdong Street.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:17:16', '2026-07-23 02:17:16'),
(7552, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 126, 5, 'Seoul - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Free time in the morning, visiting a local supermarket for last-minute souvenirs, then transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:17:16', '2026-07-23 02:17:16'),
(7558, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 127, 1, 'Jakarta - Incheon', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Incheon with a premium airline. Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:48:12', '2026-07-23 02:48:12'),
(7559, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 127, 2, 'Incheon - Nami Island - Seoul', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Incheon, welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit a Ski Resort (December-February period, photo stop, ski equipment not included) or Eunpyeong Hanok Village, then Nami Island (filming location of \'Winter Sonata\') and Gangnam COEX Mall with the Starfield Library. Check in at a 3-star (or similar) hotel/condotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:48:12', '2026-07-23 02:48:12'),
(7560, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 127, 3, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Gyeongbokgung Palace &amp; the National Folklore Museum, passing the Blue House, Itaewon Mosque, and Noksapyeong Street, make kimbap and wear hanbok, visit Namsan Seoul Tower with the Love &amp; Lock padlocks, and shop at Dongdaemun.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:48:12', '2026-07-23 02:48:12'),
(7561, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 127, 4, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the National Ginseng Museum, a healthcare shop (Red Pine Tree), a duty-free shop, a K-cosmetics shop, and shop at Myeongdong Street.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:48:12', '2026-07-23 02:48:12'),
(7562, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 127, 5, 'Seoul - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer from the hotel to a local supermarket for last-minute shopping and breakfast, then transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 02:48:12', '2026-07-23 02:48:12'),
(7575, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 128, 1, 'Jakarta - Incheon', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Incheon with Garuda Indonesia. Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:11:29', '2026-07-23 03:11:29'),
(7576, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 128, 2, 'Incheon - Nami Island', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Incheon, welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit Nami Island (filming location of \'Winter Sonata\'), learn to make kimbap and wear hanbok. In the evening, shop at Hongdae Youth Avenue. Check in at a 3-star hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:11:29', '2026-07-23 03:11:29'),
(7577, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 128, 3, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the National Ginseng Museum and a K-cosmetics shop, Gyeongbokgung Palace &amp; the National Folk Museum (hanbok not included), passing the Blue House, Itaewon, Dongdaemun, and Cheonggyecheon Stream.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:11:29', '2026-07-23 03:11:29'),
(7578, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 128, 4, 'Seoul - Busan', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shopping tour at a Red Pine shop, an amethyst shop, a duty-free shop, and Myeongdong Street, then continue to Busan, crossing the Gwanganri Bridge for its night view.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:11:29', '2026-07-23 03:11:29'),
(7579, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 128, 5, 'Busan City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Haedong Yonggungsa Temple, Blue Line Park (including the Capsule Train), Haeundae Beach, Gamcheon Cultural Village, BIFF Market, and Kukje Market.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:11:29', '2026-07-23 03:11:29'),
(7580, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 128, 6, 'Busan - Seoul - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Return to Seoul, visit a local supermarket for souvenirs, then transfer to Incheon Airport for the flight back to Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:11:29', '2026-07-23 03:11:29'),
(7581, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 129, 1, 'Jakarta - Kuala Lumpur - On Board - Transit', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport for the flight to Seoul via a Kuala Lumpur transit with Malaysia Airlines. Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:13:12', '2026-07-23 03:13:12'),
(7582, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 129, 2, 'Arrival Incheon - Incheon City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Incheon in the morning, visit Incheon Inspire Entertainment Resort, Incheon China Town &amp; Songwol Fairy Tale Village, the seaside atmosphere of Wolmido Theme Park, and shop at Incheon Underground Shopping Mall. Check in at a 3-star hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:13:12', '2026-07-23 03:13:12'),
(7583, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 129, 3, 'Seoul City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Gwangmyeong Cave (a former mine turned into a creative tourist attraction), the Starfield Library &amp; COEX Mall, HiKR Ground, photos at N Seoul Tower (via Electric Bus), and Hongdae Youth Avenue.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:13:12', '2026-07-23 03:13:12'),
(7584, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 129, 4, 'Seoul Heritage & Shopping', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the National Ginseng Museum and a K-cosmetics shop, Gyeongbokgung Palace and the National Museum, and shop at Dongdaemun Fashion Town.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:13:12', '2026-07-23 03:13:12'),
(7585, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 129, 5, 'Seoul City Tour - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit a Red Pine Tree shop and an amethyst shop, experience making kimchi &amp; wearing hanbok, a duty-free shop, free time at Myeongdong Street, and a local supermarket before heading to the airport.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:13:12', '2026-07-23 03:13:12'),
(7586, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 129, 6, 'On Flight - Arrival Jakarta', 'Flight back to Jakarta via Kuala Lumpur.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:13:12', '2026-07-23 03:13:12'),
(7587, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 133, 1, 'Jakarta - Osaka', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Depart for Osaka with Malaysia Airlines (CGK-KUL MH-720, KUL-KIX MH-052). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:17:14', '2026-07-23 03:17:14'),
(7588, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 133, 2, 'Osaka - Universal Studios Japan', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Universal Studios Japan with rides including Super Nintendo World, The Wizarding World of Harry Potter, Jurassic Park, and more, then shop at Shinsaibashi.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:17:14', '2026-07-23 03:17:14'),
(7589, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 133, 3, 'Osaka - Kyoto - Toyohashi', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Kiyomizu Temple/Kinkakuji Temple and Fushimi Inari Taisha, then continue to Toyohashi.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:17:14', '2026-07-23 03:17:14'),
(7590, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 133, 4, 'Toyohashi - Lake Kawaguchi - Gotemba', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Lake Kawaguchi, ride the Shinkansen Toyohashi-Hamamatsu (1 stop), and shop at Gotemba Premium Outlet.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:17:14', '2026-07-23 03:17:14'),
(7591, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 133, 5, 'Tokyo City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Photo stop at Fujiten Ski Resort, visiting Asakusa Kannon Temple (Sensoji), Tokyo Sky Tree, and Shibuya with the Hachiko monument.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:17:14', '2026-07-23 03:17:14'),
(7592, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 133, 6, 'Tokyo Disney Sea', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">A full day at Tokyo Disney Sea (one-day pass included). Can be swapped for Tokyo Disney Land, confirmed at booking.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:17:14', '2026-07-23 03:17:14'),
(7593, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 133, 7, 'Tokyo - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to the airport for the flight back (NRT-KUL MH-089, KUL-CGK MH-727).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:17:15', '2026-07-23 03:17:15'),
(7594, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 1, 'Jakarta - Tokyo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Depart for Tokyo with All Nippon Airways NH 836 (06.20-15.40). Welcomed by a guide and transferred to the hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7595, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 2, 'Tokyo Disneyland', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">A full day at Tokyo Disney Land (one-day pass included). Can be swapped for Tokyo Disney Sea, confirmed at booking.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7596, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 3, 'Tokyo - Hokkaido - Lake Toya', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Domestic flight to Hokkaido (HND-CTS NH 987). Visit Noboribetsu Jigokudani (Hell Valley) and Date Jidaimura.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7597, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 4, 'Lake Toya - Otaru - Sapporo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Otaru Canal, the Music Box Museum, Kitaichi Glass Factory, Sakaimachi Street, and Ramen Alley in Sapporo.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7598, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 5, 'Sapporo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Maruyama Zoo, Odori Park, the Hokkaido Government Building (photo stop), and the Ishiya Chocolate Factory (entrance ticket included).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7599, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 6, 'Sapporo - Biei - Sapporo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Biei Blue Pond and the Furano Ski Area (activity costs at own expense), free time shopping at Susukino.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7600, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 7, 'Sapporo - Haneda', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Nijo Morning Market and Mitsui Factory Outlet, then a domestic flight Chitose-Haneda NH 82. Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7601, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 131, 8, 'Haneda - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Flight back to Jakarta with NH 871 (00.05-06.00).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:21:28', '2026-07-23 03:21:28'),
(7602, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 132, 1, 'Jakarta - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport for the flight to Fukuoka via Kuala Lumpur (MH 722, MH 056). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:27:24', '2026-07-23 03:27:24'),
(7603, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 132, 2, 'Fukuoka - Yufuin - Beppu - Oita', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Yunotsubo Street, Yufuin Floral Village, and Beppu Umi Jigoku (entrance ticket included), then continue to Oita.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:27:24', '2026-07-23 03:27:24'),
(7604, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 132, 3, 'Oita - Fukuoka', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Stop at Tosu Premium Outlets, then continue to Fukuoka visiting Canal City Hakata and the Tenjin District.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:27:24', '2026-07-23 03:27:24'),
(7605, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 132, 4, 'Fukuoka Free Day', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Free day in Fukuoka without bus or guide, free to explore independently.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:27:24', '2026-07-23 03:27:24'),
(7606, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 132, 5, 'Fukuoka - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to Fukuoka Airport for the flight back to Jakarta via Kuala Lumpur (MH 057, MH 725).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 03:27:24', '2026-07-23 03:27:24'),
(7607, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 134, 1, 'Kota Keberangkatan - Osaka', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at the airport of your departure city (Jakarta/Surabaya/Denpasar/Medan) for the flight to Osaka with Malaysia Airlines via Kuala Lumpur (KUL-KIX MH052). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:35:13', '2026-07-23 06:35:13'),
(7608, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 134, 2, 'Osaka - Kyoto - Gifu', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Shinsaibashi-Dotonbori, Fushimi Inari, and Kiyomizu Temple/Kinkakuji Temple (subject to conditions), then continue to Gifu.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:35:13', '2026-07-23 06:35:13'),
(7609, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 134, 3, 'Gifu - Shirakawago - Takayama - Hamamatsu', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Shirakawago Village and Takayama Old Town, enjoying an authentic Japanese onsen soak at the hotel.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:35:13', '2026-07-23 06:35:13'),
(7610, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 134, 4, 'Mt. Fuji - Tokyo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the Mount Fuji area, shop at Gotemba Premium Outlet, and Lake Kawaguchi.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:35:13', '2026-07-23 06:35:13'),
(7611, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 134, 5, 'Tokyo Free Day', 'Free day to explore Tokyo all day (without bus or guide).', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:35:13', '2026-07-23 06:35:13'),
(7612, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 134, 6, 'Tokyo City Tour - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Asakusa, a photo stop at Tokyo Sky Tree, and Odaiba with its transformer robot monument, then continue to the airport (NRT-KUL MH071).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:35:13', '2026-07-23 06:35:13'),
(7613, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 134, 7, 'Kuala Lumpur - Kota Asal', 'Connecting flight back to your departure city (Jakarta/Surabaya/Denpasar/Medan).', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:35:13', '2026-07-23 06:35:13'),
(7614, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 135, 1, 'Jakarta - Osaka', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport for the flight to Osaka (several flight options MH716/MH720/MH722 via Kuala Lumpur with Malaysia Airlines, or reverse route with Garuda Indonesia). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:41:23', '2026-07-23 06:41:23'),
(7615, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 135, 2, 'Osaka - Kyoto - Gifu', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Shinsaibashi-Dotonbori, Fushimi Inari (for Philippine Airlines flights, go straight to hotel check-in), and Kiyomizu Temple/Kinkakuji Temple (subject to conditions), then continue to Gifu.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:41:23', '2026-07-23 06:41:23'),
(7616, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 135, 3, 'Gifu - Shirakawago - Takayama - Matsumoto', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Shirakawago Village with its traditional gassho-zukuri houses and Takayama Old Town, then continue to Matsumoto.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:41:23', '2026-07-23 06:41:23'),
(7617, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 135, 4, 'Matsumoto - Mt. Fuji', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the Mount Fuji area, Oshino Hakkai Village, and Lake Kawaguchi.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:41:23', '2026-07-23 06:41:23'),
(7618, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 135, 5, 'Kawaguchi - Gotemba - Tokyo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shop at Gotemba Premium Outlet, visiting Asakusa with a photo stop at Tokyo Sky Tree, and Odaiba with its transformer robot monument.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:41:23', '2026-07-23 06:41:23'),
(7619, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 135, 6, 'Tokyo Free Day', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Free day to explore Tokyo all day (without bus or guide).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:41:23', '2026-07-23 06:41:23'),
(7620, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 135, 7, 'Kuala Lumpur - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Flight back to Jakarta (NRT-KUL MH089, then KUL-CGK MH725 or MH727 with Malaysia Airlines).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:41:23', '2026-07-23 06:41:23'),
(7621, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 130, 1, 'Jakarta - Osaka', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport for the flight to Osaka with Malaysia Airlines (CGK-KUL MH-720, KUL-KIX MH-052). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:46:42', '2026-07-23 06:46:42'),
(7622, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 130, 2, 'Osaka - Kyoto - Gifu', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Welcomed by a guide, visiting Shinsaibashi-Dotonbori, Fushimi Inari, and Kiyomizu Temple/Kinkakuji Temple (subject to conditions). Continue to Gifu.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:46:42', '2026-07-23 06:46:42'),
(7623, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 130, 3, 'Gifu - Shirakawago - Takayama - Matsumoto', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Shirakawago Village with its traditional gassho-zukuri houses and Takayama Old Town, then continue to Matsumoto.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:46:42', '2026-07-23 06:46:42'),
(7624, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 130, 4, 'Matsumoto - Lake Kawaguchi - Gotemba', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Lake Kawaguchi with views of Mount Fuji, Oshino Hakkai Village, and shop at Gotemba Premium Outlet.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:46:42', '2026-07-23 06:46:42'),
(7625, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 130, 5, 'Kawaguchi - Tokyo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Head to Tokyo, visiting Asakusa Kannon Temple (Sensoji), a photo stop at Tokyo Sky Tree, and Shibuya with the Hachiko monument.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:46:42', '2026-07-23 06:46:42'),
(7626, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 130, 6, 'Tokyo Disney Land', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">A full day at Tokyo Disney Land (one-day pass included). Can be swapped for Tokyo Disney Sea, confirmed at booking.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:46:42', '2026-07-23 06:46:42'),
(7627, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 130, 7, 'Tokyo - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to the airport for the flight back (NRT-KUL MH-089, KUL-CGK MH-727).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 06:46:42', '2026-07-23 06:46:42'),
(7628, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 1, 'Jakarta - Singapore', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for the flight to Turkiye via Singapore Airlines (Premium Airlines). Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7629, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 2, 'Singapore - Istanbul - Bursa', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Istanbul, welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, visit the Blue Mosque and Hippodrome Square, photos in front of Topkapi Palace and Hagia Sophia Mosque, then continue to Bursa for hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7630, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 3, 'Bursa - Mt. Uludag - Kusadasi', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shopping at a Turkish Delight shop, visiting the Ottoman-style Grand Mosque and the Silk Market, then Mt. Uludag (round-trip cable car included) for the mountain snow atmosphere, followed by Kusadasi, a coastal city on the Aegean Sea.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7631, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 4, 'Kusadasi - Pamukkale', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Sirince Village and a Turkish leather shop, then Pamukkale: the Natural Park &amp; Observation Point and the Cotton Castle, natural white travertine terraces with thermal pools.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7632, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 5, 'Pamukkale - Cappadocia', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Shopping at a textile outlet, visiting the Sultanhani Caravanserai near Konya, then continuing to Cappadocia.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7633, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 6, 'Cappadocia', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Pigeon Valley &amp; Uchisar Castle, Goreme Valley &amp; its panorama, Avanos Village &amp; a pottery shop, plus shopping at Turkish carpet and jewelry shops (optional: hot air balloon flight, weather permitting).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7634, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 7, 'Cappadocia - Istanbul', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit Salt Lake for photos of the salt-lake scenery, then continue to Istanbul for hotel check-in.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7635, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 8, 'Istanbul', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Visit the Grand Bazaar, enjoy a Bosphorus Cruise along the Bosphorus Strait, and explore Taksim Square.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7636, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 9, 'Istanbul - Singapore', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast, then transfer to Istanbul Airport for the return flight via Singapore. Overnight on the flight.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7637, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 121, 10, 'Singapore - Jakarta', 'Connecting flight to Jakarta.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:01:31', '2026-07-23 07:01:31'),
(7638, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 1, 'JAKARTA – PARIS', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e24ea9140888f4f23f57db6795cc6f3e4\">Berkumpul di Bandara Soekarno Hatta 4 jam sebelum keberangkatan</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e8e519bc18afdc7febf3fe9fd62c8f796\">Check in G bagasi diurus oleh Welcome Manado Tours</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e717fe00e78c1e4acf3cb02fac46dd38d\">Penerbangan dengan Etihad Airways atau similar dan Transit di Abu Dhabi</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3ed9f8fd5b8546293325baacbea80338\">Meals on board</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7639, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 2, 'PARIS CITY TOUR', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e2ed0930e1ed6921e9923b8a84d852cb1\">Tiba di Paris</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3171fe6b0eb76a796b02136c04ec5d93\">Hari ini anda akan mengunjungi:</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eb910a10b8b08e6eaaad5684d81a01757\">Berfoto di <strong>Arc de Triomphe</strong></li><li data-list-item-id=\"eb05006361420a9c71d7756151671a73c\">Mengunjungi <strong>Eiffel Tower</strong></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3725f5668ba6cf230d1b3d0261b69c47\">Berfoto di <strong>Louvre Museum</strong></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e356719536df9e8619f3611bc584841b8\">Mengunjungi <strong>Galeries Lafayette </strong>(Mall luxury brand)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e47b30ad1c116eb3023687fbf86ad5d27\">Menikmati pengalaman <strong>Seine River Cruise </strong>membelah Paris selama 1 jam <strong>(Optional)</strong></li></ul><p>Check in Hotel : Ibis Paris La Défense or Similar (3*)</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7640, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 3, 'PARIS – LA VALLE VILLAGE / DISNEYLAND – BRUSSELS (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ec3e9e608e1135763ded725e8b37f6dc2\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ec2c2f525732d8d1ef8771d664d1723c4\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Hari ini Anda akan berbelanja di <strong>La Valle Outlet </strong>(pusat belanjaan barang branded diskon) atau bermain ke <strong>Disneyland Paris </strong>(<strong>Optional</strong>)</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ea4b25ec86d9d7b5562ad1a26364710d2\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Melanjutkan perjalanan menuju Brussels</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">·Check in Hotel : Best Western Hotel or Similar (3*)</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7641, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 4, 'BRUSSELS – AMSTERDAM (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e35e6f9aba99ae0868e36adf932989aec\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e929d00e3ef6c8ae7ec95e6d62b3f4d67\">Hari ini anda akan mengunjungi</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eb1a9e81614667c245e7189f2eccbaabb\"><strong>Atomium</strong>, bangunan tower unik berbentuk atom yang terkenal</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e74ec69de0437df8bafa7f6cbeb58deed\"><strong>Grand Palace</strong>, Istana Raja Belgia jaman dalu</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef50b0a014c5118fc03d3389dbe711761\"><strong>Manekin Piss</strong>, patung anak kecil icon Belgia yg terkenal di seluruh dunia</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e45d13b7227af321ad72a63bd47920ab3\">Melanjutkan perjalanan menuju Belanda</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e0c15c03c9edc7a2197ef0b8866238798\">Mengunjungi <strong>Dam Square</strong></li></ul><p>Check in Hotel : Ibis Schipol Airport or similar (3*)</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7642, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 5, 'AMSTERDAM – COLOGNE (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e8a714bf7a7883a5162bd494eca96819d\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef4641ba805e72de1202be5bbbf92b263\">Mengunjungi <strong>Volendam </strong>(Desa Nelayan)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e929425c310050714d6c4dfcb2ce1b066\">Mengunjungi <strong>Zaanse Schans </strong>(Desa Kincir Angin)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e4c6e3f7930962f40144d5bf9c5df1e36\"><p>Melanjutkan perjalanan menuju ke Cologne, Jerman</p><p>Check in Hotel : Moxy Cologne or similar (4*)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7643, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 6, 'COLOGNE – STRASBOURG (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e9b712d3f69561a2a3f97b381aa2bcf1a\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e4f7f4b6f14f71d2d1be1a1c3512cd804\">Di Jerman Anda akan mengunjungi:</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecc3790a4749658d676cd6c2e2c64b535\">Photostop <strong>Dom Cathedral</strong></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e6707044bb34af45140dfd6535e3e822a\">Mengunjungi <strong>Old Town Cologne</strong></li><li data-list-item-id=\"eb246c613b4dc0ff81e1548603bd5e2af\">Anda akan melakukan perjalanan menuju Strasbourg</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eaf1a28eeec75102fb37cde33ac71bc82\">Di Strasbourg Anda akan mengunjungi :</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ebc0a503199e79e1db3340252c23387c0\"><p>Petite France</p><p>Check in Hotel : 7 Spa Hotel or similar (4*)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7644, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 7, 'STRASBOURG - LAKETHUN/BRIENZ – LAUTERBRUNNEN – ZURICH (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e4b99ae6accd9f68548aefcaa228e3955\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e14c11effd695301a3579ec853fa159ac\">Pagi ini anda akan melanjutkan perjalanan menuju Swiss</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eefc0ec15ad9d25b0edd139da23d1db89\">Anda berkesempatan menyusuri Lake Thun/Brienz yang sangat indah dengan Cruise (<strong>Optional</strong>)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e921ec619e5d944db7d7fc0cd20aed93f\"><p>Mengunjungi <strong>Lauterbrunnen </strong>(Desa cantik di Swiss)</p><p>Check in Hotel : Ibis Zurich Messe Airport or Similar (3*)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7645, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 8, 'ZURICH – LUCERN – MT. TITLIS – MILAN (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e238fbebcd234f422223dc3631c5dc93c\">Sarapan pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e8a9d796c330c8eb489df87355c3b89b4\">Menuju Lucerne dan mengunjungi:</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e5342611efd1dd440f37003c100eb15d2\">Old Town &amp; Lake Lucerne</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ee45109c3312e83651026c48519fac202\">Mengunjungi <strong>Mt. Titlis dengan Cable Car </strong>(<strong>Optional</strong>) sebuah gunung di pegunungan Alps di Swiss. Ketinggian mencapai 3.000 meter lebih.</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3468583d0486b0d29f100298fd76bd4c\"><p>Melanjutkan perjalanan menuju Milan</p><p>Check in Hotel</p><p>Hotel : Ibis Milano Malpensa or similar (3*)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7646, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 9, 'MILAN – COMO – MILAN (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e20cef42c4d123c65e677102da443b7e4\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e921ab1fa5eb4825c20170f71527eac48\">Mengunjungi <strong>Lake Como </strong>yang terkenal karena keindahannya</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ec9be6b02b95873f43cb992b29de55b49\">Photostop <strong>Duomo Cathedral</strong></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecb5ceb7f5de4a1b169b26670b65f879d\">Anda memiliki waktu bebas untuk berbelanja di</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e4f713e2c26d076c7348e37cec62213ea\">Galleria Vittorio Emanuele II</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef889860be31bc071fdb995fcc6861ac3\">Kembali ke Hotel</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7647, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 10, 'MILAN – JAKARTA (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e64f551811c8aee69339aae82a763196c\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ec6f1888ae2f2051f1e0e871adc13285f\">Pagi hari ini Anda check out dan akan diantar ke Bandara untuk Penerbangan kembali ke Indonesia</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7648, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 42, 11, 'TIBA DI JAKARTA', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"efe5ff8692c0e759f246aa1a3d6f550d1\">Tiba di Jakarta dengan selamat. Semoga bertemu bersama Welcome Manado Tours trip berikutnya</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:05:37', '2026-07-23 07:05:37'),
(7658, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 1, 'Jakarta – Doha – Zurich (Meals on Flight)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta International Airport 4 hours before departure. Check-in and baggage handling arranged by Welcome Manado. Flight with Etihad/Qatar Airways/Emirates transiting via Doha/Dubai/Abu Dhabi.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7659, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 2, 'Arrival Zurich – Half Day Tour Swiss - Salzburg (No Meals)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Upon arrival in Zurich, participants stop by Zurich City Centre. Continue the journey to Salzburg. Photo stop at Mozart\'s Birthplace, the childhood home of Amadeus Mozart, a genius composer whose talent was discovered at a very young age. Visit Mirabell Garden, the filming location of The Sound of Music.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7660, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 3, 'Salzburg – Chesky Krumlov – Prague', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. The tour continues to the town of Cesky Krumlov, with its beautiful Gothic, Renaissance, and Baroque-style castle dating back to the 13th century. The area around Cesky Krumlov Castle is a UNESCO World Heritage Site. The journey continues to Prague.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7661, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 4, 'Prague – Brno', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. City tour of Prague passing Old Town Square (the heart of Prague, an old town square surrounded by historic Gothic and Baroque buildings), the Astronomical Clock (Prague Orloj), and Charles Bridge (a historic stone bridge connecting the Old Town and the Little Quarter across the Vltava River). Transfer to Brno to visit its unique Old Town.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7662, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 5, 'Brno – Budapest', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Travel to Budapest for a city tour of the city divided by the Danube River. Photo stop at Buda Castle (a historic palace complex once home to the kings of Hungary) and Fisherman Bastion (an iconic and historic neo-Romanesque monument). Optional opportunity to take a Danube River Cruise.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7663, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 6, 'Budapest – Pandorf Outlet – Vienna', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. In the morning, head to Parndorf Outlet, a large shopping outlet complex in Austria featuring many well-known designer brands at discounted prices. Visit Schoenbrunn Palace, a historic palace in Vienna and UNESCO World Heritage Site. Visit Hofburg Palace and Vienna\'s Old Town.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7664, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 7, 'Vienna – Hallstatt – Munich', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Time to visit Hallstatt, Lake Hallstatt with its natural Austrian beauty, a lakeside village that is a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Continue the journey to Munich.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7665, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 8, 'Munich – Transfer Airport', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Today, photo stop at the Olympic Stadium. Visit BMW World to see the latest BMW car models. Photo stop at Allianz Arena. In the afternoon, transfer to the airport with a transit in Dubai.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7666, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 137, 9, 'Doha – Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrival in Jakarta. We hope this journey has been a memorable one.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:19:10', '2026-07-23 07:19:10'),
(7667, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 1, 'JAKARTA – NEW YORK', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e281dcae08fc7f8da2a9c58bf202d30b3\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Hari ini berkumpul di bandara internasional Soekarno Hatta 4 jam sebelum keberangkatan</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3faacaac54ce0d40ec53422b900d63cb\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in &amp; Bagasi diurus oleh Welcome Manado Tours</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e8aa252c1a91f20510446557cc388602e\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Penerbangan dengan Turkies Airlines atau maskapai serupa dan<strong> </strong>transit</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e044b987dfbcfeecc34a77b0303ed64e3\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Penerbangan lanjutan menuju New York</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef2ce465f140361bc58e691e342a1739b\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Makan dan minum disediakan di pesawat</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7668, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 2, 'ARRIVE IN NEW YORK  (No Meals)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ed3ef58cb09af7b55aef2f55a2eda64c5\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Tiba di <strong>JFK/Newmark Liberty International Airport</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e4111de1b4e93aa528503ff9979b1f5c2\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Berfoto di <strong>UN Building</strong>, <strong>Rockerfellar</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e1759cf566017f9bc1632e9960259f53e\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Mengunjungi <strong>Ground Zero</strong>, <strong>Trinity Chruch</strong>, <strong>Wallstreet</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ed54f41a168174e443f4d08990fbf507e\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : La Quinta Clifton Rutherford or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7669, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 3, 'NEW YORK (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ea195f42ced5c7e52b07ade722abf4879\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">New York City tour :</p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"edb57787e87cff561ba32effae142842d\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Liberty Cruise</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ec2b9ceb2d051f25d66c8e164e59778e1\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Empire State Building</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ecabbc43a8330596c9dee60ddcae7a8d0\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>5th Avenue</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e02e5e21a3dd31c0252e17eb519ec82ce\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Time Square</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e873ccf425df9fd19a15cff9836362f14\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : La Quinta Clifton Rutherford or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7670, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 4, 'NEW YORK – WOODBURRY OUTLET – BOSTON (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ece88ac880cf443e14e4f6b1aa9c2d5f1\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e602075e41b3d8490034754d1cf1676c8\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to <strong>Woodburry Common Premium Outlet</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"eea3c7cb31105400ca6571ad52025d214\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Free time for shopping</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e294d19a863033777a909ed9c20f578e1\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan menuju <strong>Boston</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e9b8a95a30e686771d8634b739e45135a\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : Holiday Inn Boston Logan Airport or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7671, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 5, 'BOSTON – MONTREAL (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ebba0b5f93ce82dc55eca8fa623d84921\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e06e1124c7dffe2f3617e6bd7d88a5034\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Melewati <strong>Massachusetts Institute of Technology</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ed4645d32fabee6313eaeb941d0fcbe4d\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Mengunjungi <strong>Harvard University</strong> dan <strong>Campus Tour</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e52fa6eac9a2a880fb1c9e1b1afdfd949\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Mengunjungi <strong>John Hancock Tower</strong>, <strong>Quincy Market</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e7b5240d0d09ddb739eb3b4c7719e65d1\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Mengunjungi<strong> Copley Square</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e4c84ee62bf3d23f66e3f5b90626f6ed3\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : Holiday Inn Montreal-Longueil or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7672, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 6, 'MONTREAL – QUEBEC – MONTREAL (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e3b817e67b25f4d3a510a8daa4fab5faf\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Quebec</strong> City Tour :</p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e6f1c195374b0c73b7dfbe5e53fbf3dee\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>City Hall</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"eb453a5ccd9e97dbc18e167af3948a610\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Citadelle</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e0ae6e302e5c6df7b7a12a676b5abebf8\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Chateu Fronteac</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Kembali ke Montreal</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ee032194b25d536ba510d60d3de408d73\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Montreal</strong> City Tour :</p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e23e679248cb7f15a3c773f8902250f45\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Old Town</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ef688b13ecd8a683caa4ddf43eb3cc885\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Notredame</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e2b30de2bec40adadcfacee36328879db\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>City Hall</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"eb50da1a084312c2451d924c390b5fe81\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : Holiday Inn Montreal-Longueil or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7673, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 7, 'MONTREAL – OTTAWA – TORONTO (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"edcedbdb147f6cbba6e11088569fbc77d\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan menuju Ottawa dan mengunjungi :</p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ed79b48c8b16f894507e3115e8ea4cca9\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Parliament Hill &amp; Building</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e591114af743afdb6d66f1a0144f0b3d2\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Ottawa Memorial</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e1dfe660c40426f1efc016389800dd074\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Embassy District</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e6b318d8e74c515d270acb566fabcec3f\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Rideau Canal</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan menuju <strong>Toronto</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e4e2049dd7a249a5791f5f8560274a41e\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel<strong> : </strong>Holiday Inn Mississauga Toronto West or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7674, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 8, 'TORONTO – NIAGARA FALLS CANADA SIDE – NEW YORK (NIAGARA) (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e2419fa9f82c1bbe918e77b99dd21cf04\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Toronto City Tour :</p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ebd638477048f2ca21e4e4ca55c84fce9\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>CN Tower</strong></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e9ccab3568c68cad1406df9543c7cb3bd\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>City Hall</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan menuju Niagara Falls Canada Side</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ea250a4e94d1c63815cb9f0c09dc18eec\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Mengunjungi <strong>Niagara Canada Side Free Program</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ec60328b7eab3de5839690c4038ec1f14\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Mengunjungi <strong>Niagara Falls Factory Outlet USA Side</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"eb6f071145c41fa53fca7091efcde167d\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : Holiday Inn Express &amp; Suites Niagara or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7675, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 9, 'NIAGARA – BALTIMORE (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e5fe7db42475302d2567427ca6becb35e\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e82e1576d6f301705b7ca555b98eb69e0\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan menuju <strong>Baltimore</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e4a2e985d76831e435548b14bbc8a87e7\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : Holiday Inn Express &amp; Suites Baltimore West Catonsville or Somilar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7676, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 10, 'BALTIMORE – WASHINGTON DC – NEW YORK (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ef9124ce842ab16c1b4367b3e03df99b7\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Washington DC City Tour :</p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ec837b145f9dd6f481b451ade90bb2eda\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Washington Monument, White House, Lincoln Memorial, Vietnam War, Korean War, Capitol Hill</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Perjalanan menuju New York</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"efe5fbba19adb1239c66c8eaea35b951a\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Check in Hotel : La Quinta Clifton Rutherford or Similar (*3)</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7677, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 11, 'NEW YORK – JAKARTA (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e18a459c32b01fa077f46e23b615b6163\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"efc443e8ecee006b9211803e57c325553\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Pagi ini Anda akan check out dan akan diantar ke Bandara untuk Penerbangan Kembali ke Jakarta Indonesia</p></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7678, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 69, 12, 'ARRIVE IN JAKARTA', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Tiba di Jakarta. Semoga perjalanan ini mengesankan.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:27:14', '2026-07-23 07:27:14'),
(7679, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 1, 'Jakarta – New York', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta International Airport 4 hours before departure today. Check-in and baggage are handled by Welcome Manado. Flight with Turkish Airlines or a similar airline, with a transit stop. Connecting flight continues to New York. Meals and drinks are served on board.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7680, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 2, 'Arrive in New York (No Meals)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive at JFK/Newark Liberty International Airport. Photo stop at the UN Building and Rockefeller.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7681, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 3, 'New York (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. New York City Tour: Liberty Cruise, Empire State Building, 5th Avenue, Times Square. Visit Ground Zero, Trinity Church, and Wall Street.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7682, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 4, 'New York – Woodbury Outlet – Boston (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Woodbury Common Premium Outlet. Free time for shopping. Continue the journey to Boston.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7683, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 5, 'Boston – Montreal (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Pass by the Massachusetts Institute of Technology. Visit Harvard University with a campus tour, John Hancock Tower, Quincy Market, and Copley Square.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7684, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 6, 'Montreal – Quebec – Montreal (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Quebec City Tour: City Hall, the Citadelle, Chateau Frontenac. Return to Montreal for a Montreal City Tour: Old Town, Notre-Dame, City Hall.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7685, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 7, 'Montreal – Ottawa – Toronto (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Travel to Ottawa to visit Parliament Hill &amp; Building, the Ottawa Memorial, the Embassy District, and the Rideau Canal. Continue the journey to Toronto.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7686, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 8, 'Toronto – Niagara Falls Canada Side – New York (Niagara) (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Toronto City Tour: CN Tower, City Hall. Travel to Niagara Falls on the Canadian side, with free time on the Canadian side, and Niagara Falls Factory Outlet on the US side.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7687, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 9, 'Niagara – Baltimore (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Continue the journey to Baltimore.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51');
INSERT INTO `itineraries` (`id`, `itinerable_type`, `itinerable_id`, `day_number`, `title`, `description`, `hotel_info`, `meals_info`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(7688, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 10, 'Baltimore – Washington DC – New York (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Washington DC City Tour: Washington Monument, the White House, Lincoln Memorial, the Vietnam War Memorial, the Korean War Memorial, and Capitol Hill. Continue the journey to New York.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7689, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 11, 'New York – Jakarta (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Check out this morning and transfer to the airport for the return flight to Jakarta, Indonesia.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7690, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 142, 12, 'Arrive in Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Jakarta. We hope this journey has been a memorable one.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 07:37:51', '2026-07-23 07:37:51'),
(7691, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 136, 1, 'Jakarta – Sydney', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport 4 hours before departure. Check-in and baggage handled by Welcome Manado. Flight with Malaysia Airlines or similar. Meals and drinks provided on board.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:08:35', '2026-07-23 08:08:35'),
(7692, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 136, 2, 'Sydney City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Sydney. Transfer to the hotel by private van (minimum 10 pax). Get around Sydney by public transport, visiting Sydney Harbour Bridge, Sydney Opera House (outside view), Queen Victoria Building, and Town Hall, plus shopping at Paddy\'s Market.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:08:35', '2026-07-23 08:08:35'),
(7693, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 136, 3, 'Sydney', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Free program or optional tour (Blue Mountain full-day tour – feeding kangaroos, koalas, and wallabies).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:08:35', '2026-07-23 08:08:35'),
(7694, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 136, 4, 'Sydney – Melbourne', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to the airport by private van (minimum 10 pax). Domestic flight to Melbourne. Pick-up at the airport by private van (minimum 10 pax). Get around Melbourne by public transport, visiting Elizabeth Street, St. Paul\'s Cathedral, and Flinders Street Station.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:08:35', '2026-07-23 08:08:35'),
(7695, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 136, 5, 'Melbourne', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">In Melbourne, visit the Brighton Bathing Boxes and Queen Victoria Market.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:08:35', '2026-07-23 08:08:35'),
(7696, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 136, 6, 'Melbourne – Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">In the morning, transfer to the airport by private van (minimum 10 pax) for the flight back to Jakarta, Indonesia. Arrive in Jakarta, Indonesia.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:08:35', '2026-07-23 08:08:35'),
(7700, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 1, 'Jakarta – Queenstown', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport 4 hours before departure. Check-in and baggage are handled by Welcome Manado. Flight with Qantas Airways or similar, transiting in Sydney/Melbourne. Meals and drinks are served on board.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:19', '2026-07-23 08:32:19'),
(7701, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 2, 'Queenstown', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Queenstown. Visit Lake Wakatipu and Queenstown City Center.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:20', '2026-07-23 08:32:20'),
(7702, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 3, 'Queenstown', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Coronet Peak. Skyline Gondola, skydiving, and jet boating (optional).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:20', '2026-07-23 08:32:20'),
(7703, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 4, 'Queenstown – Te Anau – Milford Sound – Queenstown', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Today, visit Milford Sound Cruise (entrance ticket excluded) and Lake Wakatipu.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:20', '2026-07-23 08:32:20'),
(7704, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 5, 'Queenstown – Arrow Town – Lake Tekapo', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Today, visit Lake Pukaki, the Maori Cultural Village, Lake Tekapo, and the Shepherd Church at Tekapo.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:20', '2026-07-23 08:32:20'),
(7705, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 6, 'Lake Tekapo – Aoraki Mt. Cook - Christchurch', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Mt. Cook National Park, 1-hour trek (entrance ticket included). Transfer to Christchurch.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:20', '2026-07-23 08:32:20'),
(7706, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 7, 'Christchurch', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Today, explore Christchurch City Center. Optional tour: sightseeing by tram, punting on the Avon River, and Christchurch Gondola.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:20', '2026-07-23 08:32:20'),
(7707, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 138, 8, 'Christchurch – Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Transfer to the airport. Flight to Jakarta with a transit in Sydney. Arrive safely in Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:32:20', '2026-07-23 08:32:20'),
(7708, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 1, 'JAKARTA – MOSCOW', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e77faab50d231a3f3166a79ab708828c1\">Berkumpul di Bandara Soekarno Hatta 4 jam sebelum keberangkatan</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecf37a3331ec2c3d337a1fd57fe40cece\">Check in &amp; bagasi diurus oleh Welcome Manado Tours.</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e42c941633079ab9e6ecd32976024c2a6\">Penerbangan menuju Moscow dengan Qatar Airways/Etihad Airways dan transit di Doha/Abu Dhabi</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e044860fb763d3c8443f5acbff2a25a60\">Makan &amp; Minum disediakan di pesawat</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7709, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 2, 'MOSCOW (No Meal)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ed612c32617e194f8dcab8a6391af14dd\">Tiba di Moscow</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef703ceac894ba14c8c4e3d33f31da8c6\">Check in Hotel Beta Izmailovo or Similar (3*)</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7710, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 3, 'MOSCOW (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e417802f6bfc9fbb784b54adf7755560c\"><p>Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p><p>Di Moscow Anda akan mengunjungi :</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"ec72b71952330277f1fbd6c4be62da0c1\">Red Square</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3cd9d8742f125519c4612373332d64c5\">GUM Department (Pusat perbelanjaan tertua dan megah di Moscow)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e93951d882900bc999058aaa2d4d4afeb\">St. Basil’s Cathedral</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ee162dc7a90d982e7dbd131c497de6607\">Berfoto di Bolshoi Theater</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e87883f9c9ad6e7679d71289be75e3439\">Tsaritsyno Palace (Optional Baju Khas Russia)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e6fbeee428795e25d288c50d615a5c57f\">Back to Hotel Beta Izmailovo or Similar (3*)</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7711, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 4, 'MOSCOW – MURMANSK (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"eafb43a4155e3f2480b1eb3aeaf105a0c\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e30023de4191b2a89b304c2a8d78d5ee7\">Selanjutnya anda akan diantar menuju Bandara untuk</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e512f8af2e05200691ac95a4f250b34fb\">penerbangan menuju Murmansk by Domestic Flight</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ed3bc7d358b4a29c00976271e5426620e\">(Sudah termasuk Tiket Pesawat Tanpa Bagasi)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e87576ccdc246e4cc9d71c73d1337da4e\">Tiba di Murmansk</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e6766dc83fd5f4913584aa49e88859fac\">HUNTING AURORA BOREALIS (Include)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e0c0df7ed58522959c0b005590b926f59\">Check in Hotel 69 Pararel or Similar (2*)</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7712, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 5, 'MURMANSK – SAAMI VILLAGE (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e674689f8f549c075deb229f961b9878e\"><p>Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</p><p>Di Murmansk anda akan mengunjungi :</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"eca0c4315b6c41bd0cd3a59886d497fd0\">Historical Lenin Ice Breaker</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef52862eb5185fe5cb5d9d32b9a34ca47\">Saami Village</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecb1c857a0fa07fe78e494474810f86b4\">HUSKY SLEDDING &amp; SNOWMOBILE (Optional)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3a5a1db5696e1dd696a488742a2377aa\">Back to Hotel 69 Pararel or Similar (2*)</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7713, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 6, 'MURMANSK – ST. PETERSBURG (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e8e2b62561cc53f8d809557a0be873885\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"efc18ccddadb2c4dc80d808d82d800af0\">Pagi hari Anda akan Check Out Hotel dan akan diantar</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e15d8b3dca179a4c31acddb6caa4adf88\">menuju St. Petersburg by Domestic Flight (Sudah</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eda70cc1792bd9d45f2080eb6aa2f93cc\">termasuk Tiket Pesawat Tanpa Bagasi)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e03bfb0c8b50fa2ddfae4e4f8b572d1cf\">Tiba di St. Petersburg</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e751c0fdf36df5b6f9f0796b5a8e87eb1\">Mengunjungi Peterhof Palace</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e150e7b4473d1778197d40721dcc67ed1\">Check in Hotel Ibis St Petersburg Center or Similar (3*)</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7714, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 7, 'ST. PETERSBURG (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e8b41e45c8d237cf65ce9f47d85744820\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e5bd087c50e192f6a2c09b41534565f3f\">Hari ini Anda akan mengunjungi :</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eeaf3e90c7814b10b47a17b549d6a8c43\">Kazan Cathedral</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e162da0d7411a49fd7eb742cdab870e33\">Chruch of Savior on Blood</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e359efcde1ccec4e8244fa8538f4f40ae\">Hermintage Museum (Exclude Ticket)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e2b271e56ab497901a4d2bac0a47ce927\">Melewati Palace Square</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e948f0b7d8ab90d2ed970e7794cc12319\">Back to Hotel Ibis St Petersburg Center or Similar (3*)</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7715, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 8, 'ST. PETERSBURG – MOSCOW (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e233f1d8e093c75f11b1cd6e44b6768b6\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e5db9d60a6fe3391b5efbb831a2d2f255\">Mengunjungi :</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e7bdf021bac7a8a99525a69c1785bdcb6\">St. Isaac Cathedral</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef6ee7a50645a2d5897a47cf082ef8578\">Berfoto di Masjid Biru/ Masjid Soekarno</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e0b107c36dd35e839c5f67a7a056f496b\">Peter Paul Firtress</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e9630a5d8715585ce4fabb49aab48520a\">Selanjutnya anda akan diantar menuju Stasiun untuk perjalanan menuju Moscow (Sapsan Tarin/ Include Ticket)</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e9540e6bf5d7720a2f7c95718b3f7ef1c\">Tiba di Moscow</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ed1c9059b83f43db1e36aaa92ee33685a\">Check in Hotel Beta Izmailovo or Similar (3*)</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7716, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 9, 'MOSCOW (B)', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e4383f9b1f35d18882c249ec4ac74011c\">Sarapan Pagi di Hotel</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecd6e766a98284c15b5d8529352d539e2\">Free time di Izmailovo Market</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e737e5bf54b9a2608674cb6ce458de084\">Selanjutnya Anda akan di antar menuju ke Bandara untuk penerbangan pulang ke Jakarta, Indonesia dengan Qatar/Etihad Airways dan transit di Doha/Abu Dhabi</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7717, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 47, 10, 'JAKARTA', '<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e0510b8418b6cb807e71560daba31ef19\">Tiba di Jakarta dengan Selamat. Semoga bertemu Bersama Welcome Manado Tours dalam trip berikutnya.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 08:54:39', '2026-07-23 08:54:39'),
(7728, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 1, 'Jakarta – Moscow', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport 4 hours before departure. Check-in and baggage are handled by Welcome Manado. Flight to Moscow with Qatar Airways/Etihad Airways, transiting in Doha/Abu Dhabi. Meals and drinks are served on board.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7729, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 2, 'Moscow (No Meal)', 'Arrive in Moscow.', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7730, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 3, 'Moscow (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Red Square in Moscow, the GUM Department Store (Moscow\'s oldest and grandest shopping center), St. Basil\'s Cathedral, a photo stop at the Bolshoi Theater, and Tsaritsyno Palace (optional traditional Russian costume photo).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7731, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 4, 'Moscow – Murmansk (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the airport for a domestic flight to Murmansk (flight ticket without baggage included). Arrive in Murmansk. Aurora Borealis hunting (included).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7732, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 5, 'Murmansk – Saami Village (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit the Historical Lenin Icebreaker and the Saami Village in Murmansk. Husky sledding and snowmobile (optional).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7733, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 6, 'Murmansk – St. Petersburg (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Check out in the morning and transfer for a domestic flight to St. Petersburg (flight ticket without baggage included). Arrive in St. Petersburg. Visit Peterhof Palace.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7734, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 7, 'St. Petersburg (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Today, visit Kazan Cathedral, the Church of the Savior on Spilled Blood, and the Hermitage Museum (entrance ticket excluded), passing by Palace Square.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7735, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 8, 'St. Petersburg – Moscow (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit St. Isaac\'s Cathedral, take photos at the Blue Mosque/Soekarno Mosque, and the Peter and Paul Fortress. Afterward, transfer to the station for the journey to Moscow (Sapsan Train, ticket included). Arrive in Moscow.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7736, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 9, 'Moscow (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Free time at Izmailovo Market. Afterward, transfer to the airport for the return flight to Jakarta, Indonesia with Qatar/Etihad Airways, transiting in Doha/Abu Dhabi.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7737, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 139, 10, 'Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive safely in Jakarta. We hope to see you again with Welcome Manado on your next trip.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:08:11', '2026-07-23 09:08:11'),
(7738, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 1, 'Jakarta – Zurich', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport 4 hours before departure. Check-in and baggage handling arranged by Welcome Manado. Flight with Turkish Airlines or similar airline. Meals and drinks served on board.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7739, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 2, 'Zurich – Rhine Falls – Titisee – Montreux', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive at Zurich Airport. Take photos at Rhine Falls (Europe\'s largest waterfall). Visit Lake Titisee. Continue the journey to Montreux.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7740, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 3, 'Montreux – Geneva – Annecy (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. In Montreux City Centre, visit the Lake Geneva Promenade, Chillon Castle, and the Freddie Mercury Statue. Transfer to Geneva to visit Lake Geneva, The Flower Clock, The Jet d\'Eau, the Red Cross Building, and the UN Building.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7741, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 4, 'Annecy – Chamonix – Mont Blanc (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Lake Annecy, Jardins de l\'Europe, and Pont des Amours. Explore Chamonix City Centre. Try the Alpine Coaster toboggan ride in Chamonix (Mont Blanc).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7742, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 5, 'Chamonix – Tasch – Zermatt – Gornergrat – Zermatt (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Today, travel to Zermatt by Panoramic Train. Explore the car-free Zermatt Village. Panoramic Train ride to Gornergrat (optional).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7743, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 6, 'Zermatt – Gruyeres – Bern (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. In Gruyeres, visit Chateau de Gruyeres, the Gruyere Cheese Factory &amp; Museum, and Maison Cailler. Continue to the city of Bern to visit Bern City Centre and the Aare River.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7744, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 7, 'Bern – Grindelwald – Jungfraujoch – Lauterbrunnen – Zurich (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. In Grindelwald, visit Grindelwald City Centre and Jungfraujoch - Top of Europe (optional). Continue to Lauterbrunnen to visit Lauterbrunnen Village &amp; City Centre.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7745, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 8, 'Zurich – Lucerne – Zurich (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Today, visit Chapel Bridge, Lucerne City Centre, and Lake Lucerne. Continue to Zurich to visit Bahnhofstrasse and Lake Zurich.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7746, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 9, 'Zurich - Lugano - Milan (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Lugano City Centre and Lake Lugano. Continue the journey to Milan to visit Milan Cathedral (Duomo di Milano) and Galleria Vittorio Emanuele II.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7747, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 10, 'Milan - Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. This morning, check out and transfer to the airport for the return flight to Indonesia.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7748, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 140, 11, 'Tiba di Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive safely in Jakarta. We hope to see you again on your next trip with Welcome Manado.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:45:01', '2026-07-23 09:45:01'),
(7749, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 1, 'Jakarta – London', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport 4 hours before departure. Check-in and baggage are handled by Welcome Manado. Flight with Etihad Airways or similar, transiting in Abu Dhabi. Connecting flight continues on to London. Meals &amp; drinks are served on board.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7750, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 2, 'London City Tour', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in London. London City Tour: visit Westminster Abbey, the London Eye, Big Ben, and Tower Bridge, with the option to enjoy a Thames River Cruise. Visit Buckingham Palace.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7751, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 3, 'London – Oxford – Bicester – London (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Oxford City Centre. Enjoy shopping today at Bicester Outlet. Afterwards, transfer back to London.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7752, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 4, 'London - Liverpool - Manchester (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Continue the journey to Liverpool. Take photos at Anfield Stadium (Liverpool FC). Take photos at Old Trafford Stadium (Manchester United). Visit the Trafford Centre.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7753, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 5, 'Manchester - York - Edinburgh (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit York Minster. Edinburgh City Tour: take photos in front of Edinburgh Castle and explore Edinburgh City Centre.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7754, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 6, 'Edinburgh - Glasgow - Belfast (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Continue the journey to Glasgow. Glasgow City Tour. Continue on to Cairnryan and cross by ferry to Belfast (the ferry crossing takes approximately 2.5 hours). Arrive in Belfast and transfer to the hotel to rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7755, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 7, 'Belfast (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Today, explore Belfast: Belfast City Hall, Belfast Castle, the Giant\'s Causeway, and The Dark Hedges (one of the filming locations of Game of Thrones).</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7756, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 8, 'Belfast - Dublin (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Continue the journey to Dublin. Temple Bar Street, Dublin. Dublin City Centre. Dublin Mosque.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7757, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 9, 'Dublin - Jakarta (B)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. This morning, check out and transfer to the airport for the return flight to Indonesia.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7758, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 141, 10, 'Jakarta', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive safely in Jakarta. We hope to see you again with Welcome Manado on your next trip.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-23 09:58:55', '2026-07-23 09:58:55'),
(7759, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 111, 1, 'Kuala Lumpur Arrival - Sepang Circuit', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Arrive in Kuala Lumpur and be welcomed by an Indonesian-speaking guide, then head straight to Sepang International Circuit to watch MotoGP Qualifying (K1 ticket). Check in at the hotel (Kingston Hotel or similar) and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-24 02:13:38', '2026-07-24 02:13:38'),
(7760, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 111, 2, 'Kuala Lumpur City Tour - Sprint Race', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel, then head to Sepang Circuit to watch Qualifying &amp; the Sprint Race, followed by a city tour of the Twin Towers &amp; Dataran Merdeka. Return to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-24 02:13:38', '2026-07-24 02:13:38'),
(7761, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 111, 3, 'MotoGP Race - Departure', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast and check-out, then head to Sepang Circuit to watch the Grand Prix MotoGP: Moto3 (12.00-13.00) / Moto2 (13.20-14.20) / MotoGP (15.00-16.00). After the race, transfer to KLIA.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-24 02:13:38', '2026-07-24 02:13:38'),
(7763, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 40, 1, 'ITINERARY', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah sarapan, Anda akan dijemput di hotel di kawasan pusat Kota Manado dan menuju <strong>Dermaga Bahowo</strong>. Dari dermaga, perjalanan dilanjutkan dengan private boat menuju <strong>Pulau Manado Tua</strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setibanya di pulau, petualangan dimulai dengan trekking menuju Gunung Manado Tua selama kurang lebih 3 jam. Jalur trekking melewati hutan tropis dan perkebunan masyarakat yang ditumbuhi pala, cengkih, kelapa, pisang, mangga, serta berbagai tanaman tropis. Selama perjalanan, Anda juga berkesempatan menikmati suasana alam dan, jika beruntung, melihat satwa endemik Sulawesi seperti <strong>Tarsius, Yaki (Black Crested Macaque), dan berbagai burung endemik</strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah trekking, perjalanan dilanjutkan dengan boat menuju <strong>Taman Nasional Bunaken</strong>. Nikmati waktu untuk mengeksplorasi keindahan laut Bunaken dengan aktivitas snorkeling atau diving sebagai pilihan tambahan. Makan siang berupa lunch box akan disajikan dan dapat dinikmati di atas boat.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Setelah selesai menikmati Bunaken, perjalanan kembali menuju <strong>Dermaga Bahowo</strong>, kemudian Anda akan diantar kembali ke hotel di Kota Manado.</p>', NULL, 'LUNCH BOX', '2026-08-10 03:38:50', '2026-08-10 03:38:50'),
(7765, 'App\\Models\\ManadoTour', 41, 1, 'ITINERARY', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Pagi – Penjemputan &amp; Waruga Sawangan</strong><br>Peserta akan dijemput dari hotel di kawasan Kota Manado dan memulai perjalanan menuju <strong>Waruga Sawangan</strong>, kompleks pemakaman kuno khas Minahasa yang memiliki ratusan waruga batu. Di sini, Anda dapat mengenal lebih dekat sejarah, tradisi, dan warisan budaya masyarakat Minahasa.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Batu Angus &amp; Snorkeling</strong><br>Perjalanan dilanjutkan menuju <strong>Batu Angus</strong>, kawasan pesisir unik yang terbentuk dari aliran lava vulkanik pada masa lampau. Setelah makan siang di restoran lokal, nikmati waktu untuk menjelajahi perairan Batu Angus melalui aktivitas snorkeling. Air yang jernih memungkinkan Anda menikmati pemandangan terumbu karang, ikan tropis, dan kehidupan laut yang beragam.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Sore – Kembali ke Manado</strong><br>Setelah selesai menikmati suasana pantai dan aktivitas snorkeling, perjalanan dilanjutkan kembali menuju Kota Manado. Anda akan diantar kembali ke hotel dan tour berakhir.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>End of Tour.</strong></p>', NULL, 'LUNCH', '2026-08-12 08:18:09', '2026-08-12 08:18:09'),
(7798, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 1, 'Jakarta – Guangzhou (Meals on Board, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">CGK (08.15) - CAN (14.45) by GA 898. Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for departure to Guangzhou with Premium Airlines. Upon arrival in Guangzhou, meet the local guide and transfer to Guangzhou Tower (photo stop). Dinner, then transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7799, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 2, 'Guangzhou – Chongqing (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Board a bullet train to Chongqing. Visit Kuixinglou, a striking \'8-Dimensional\' multi-level structure. Visit Hongyadong, a cluster of traditional multi-storey buildings along the Jialing River. Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7800, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 3, 'Chongqing (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Liziba, where the light rail runs straight through the middle of an apartment building. Photo stop at People\'s Hall. Visit Ciqikou Ancient Town. Continue to Raffles City and Jiefangbei. Return to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7801, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 4, 'Chongqing (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Danzishi, a riverside area blending historic and modern architecture. Continue to Longmenhao Street. Visit Eling Park, a hilltop park with panoramic views of Chongqing city. Shopping at Guanyinqiao Street. Return to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7802, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 5, 'Chongqing – Fenghuang (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Zhuoshui Ancient Town, a historic town dating back to the Tang Dynasty. Travel to Fenghuang (approx. 3 hours by bus). Visit Fenghuang Ancient Town (including shuttle bus), passing Rainbow Bridge and the bar street, and enjoy the night view along the river. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7803, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 6, 'Fenghuang – Zhangjiajie (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Zhangjiajie (approx. 4 hours by bus). Visit Tianmen Mountain (including cable car, escalator, express rail, eco-friendly bus, shoe covers), crossing the Glass Walkway. Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7804, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 7, 'Zhangjiajie (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Zhangjiajie National Forest Park, the inspiration for the film Avatar. Ride the Bailong Elevator. View Avatar Mountain from Yuanjiajie Scenic Area. Enjoy Enchanting Terrace, First Bridge Under Heaven, and Golden Whip Stream. Return to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7805, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 8, 'Zhangjiajie (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Zhangjiajie Grand Canyon and walk across the Glass Bridge. Return to the hotel to rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7806, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 9, 'Zhangjiajie – Changsha (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Changsha (approx. 5 hours by bus). Visit IFS (featuring the rooftop KAWS statue installation), Huangxing Road, and Taiping Street. Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7807, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 10, 'Changsha - Guangzhou (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Return to Guangzhou by bullet train. Visit Yongqingfang, Shamian, and shop at Beijing Road. Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7808, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 143, 11, 'Guangzhou - Departure (Makan Pagi, Meals on Board)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">CAN (15.45) - CGK (19.40) by GA 899. Breakfast at the hotel. Free time until transfer to the airport for the return flight home.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 07:48:12', '2026-08-21 07:48:12'),
(7809, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 146, 1, 'Jakarta – Incheon (Meals on Board)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">CGK (23.15) - ICN (08.30)+1 by GA 878. Gather tonight at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for departure to Incheon with Garuda Indonesia.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:00:20', '2026-08-21 08:00:20'),
(7810, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 146, 2, 'Incheon – Jeonju (Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Upon arrival in Incheon, meet the guide and transfer to Jeonju. Visit Jeonju Jeondong Catholic Church, Gyeonggijeon, and Jeonju Hanok Village (wearing Hanbok for 1 hour). Visit Jeonju Nanjang and Nambu Market. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:00:20', '2026-08-21 08:00:20'),
(7811, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 146, 3, 'Jeonju – Seoul (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Deokjin Park, Jaman Mural Village, and Mt. Daedun (including cable car). Transfer to Seoul to visit Seongsudong Café Street. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:00:20', '2026-08-21 08:00:20'),
(7812, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 146, 4, 'Seoul City Tour (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit the National Ginseng Museum and a K-Cosmetic Shop. Visit Gyeongbokgung Palace. Watch the Painters Show. Shopping at Dongdaemun Fashion Town and pass by Cheonggyecheon Stream. Return to the hotel to rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:00:20', '2026-08-21 08:00:20'),
(7813, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 146, 5, 'Seoul City Tour (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Shopping at a Healthcare Shop and Amethyst Shop. Learn to make Kimchi and try wearing Hanbok. Take photos at N Seoul Tower (electronic bus). Visit the Itaewon area (Itaewon Mosque / filming spot of \'Itaewon Class\'). Shopping at a Duty Free Shop and Myeongdong Street before transferring to the hotel for rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:00:20', '2026-08-21 08:00:20'),
(7814, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 146, 6, 'Seoul – Departure (Makan Pagi, Meals on Board)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">ICN (10.35) - CGK (15.40) by GA 879. In the morning, return to Seoul and visit a local supermarket to shop for souvenirs before heading to Incheon Airport. Transfer to the airport for the flight back to Jakarta.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:00:20', '2026-08-21 08:00:20'),
(7815, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 1, 'Jakarta – Guangzhou (Meals on Board, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">CGK (08.15) - CAN (14.45) by GA 898. Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport Terminal 3 Ultimate for departure to Guangzhou with Premium Airlines. Upon arrival in Guangzhou, meet the local guide and transfer to Guangzhou Tower (photo stop). Dinner, then transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7816, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 2, 'Guangzhou – Chongqing (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Board a bullet train to Chongqing. Visit Kuixinglou. Visit Hongyadong. Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7817, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 3, 'Chongqing (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Ciqikou Ancient Town. Continue to Liziba. Head to Raffles City and take photos at People\'s Hall (photo stop). Finish with shopping at Jiefangbei. Return to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7818, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 4, 'Chongqing – Qianjiang – Zhangjiajie (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Qianjiang (approx. 4 hours by bus). Visit Zhuoshui Ancient Town. Continue the journey to Zhangjiajie (approx. 3.5 hours by bus). Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7819, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 5, 'Zhangjiajie (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Zhangjiajie Grand Canyon and the Glass Bridge. Visit Zhangjiajie National Forest Park and ride the Bailong Elevator. View Avatar Mountain and First Bridge Under Heaven from Yuanjiajie Scenic Area. Enjoy panoramic views of Avatar Mountain and Tianzi Mountain. Return to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7820, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 6, 'Zhangjiajie – Changsha (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Tianmen Mountain (including single cable car, escalator, eco-friendly cableway). Visit Guigu Plank Road and Glass Plank Road (including shoe covers). Visit Tianmen Cave. Travel to Changsha (approx. 4.5 hours by bus). Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7821, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 7, 'Changsha - Guangzhou (Makan Pagi)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">Breakfast at the hotel. Return to Guangzhou by bullet train. Visit Beijing Road. Check in to the hotel and rest.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7822, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 144, 8, 'Guangzhou - Departure (Makan Pagi, Meals on Board)', '<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">CAN (15.45) - CGK (19.40) by GA 899. Breakfast at the hotel. Free time until transfer to the airport for the return flight home.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:04:29', '2026-08-21 08:04:29'),
(7830, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 145, 1, 'Departure – Delhi (Meals on Board)', 'CGK (11.10) - KUL (14.20) by MH 710, KUL (18.50) - DEL (21.50) by MH 190. Gather at the airport before departure to begin the journey to India. Upon arrival in Delhi, we will be welcomed by a friendly guide and transferred to the hotel for check-in and rest.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:18:55', '2026-08-21 08:18:55'),
(7831, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 145, 2, 'Delhi – Jaipur (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Lotus Temple (Bahai Bhawan), the iconic white marble temple shaped like a lotus flower. Continue to Raj Ghat, the memorial complex marking the resting place of Mahatma Gandhi. After lunch at a local restaurant, continue to Jaipur (approx. 6 hours by bus). Upon arrival in Jaipur, check in to the hotel, have dinner, and rest.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:18:55', '2026-08-21 08:18:55'),
(7832, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 145, 3, 'Jaipur (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Amer Fort, a magnificent historic fortress, including an elephant ride up to Amer Fort. Visit Jal Mahal, a small palace in the middle of Man Sagar Lake. Lunch at the hotel, followed by a visit to City Palace and Hawa Mahal. Shopping time at Jaipur\'s traditional market. Return to the hotel for dinner and rest.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:18:55', '2026-08-21 08:18:55'),
(7833, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 145, 4, 'Jaipur – Fatehpur Sikri – Agra (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Continue the journey to Agra with a stop at Fatehpur Sikri, the historic city built by Emperor Akbar, including the Tomb of Khwaja Salim Chishti. Upon arrival in Agra, check in to the hotel and have lunch. Visit Agra Fort, a magnificent fortress on the banks of the Yamuna River. In the afternoon, return to the hotel for dinner and rest.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:18:55', '2026-08-21 08:18:55'),
(7834, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 145, 5, 'Agra (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Visit the Taj Mahal (closed every Friday), the iconic masterpiece left by the Mughal Empire. Return to the hotel for lunch, with free time to shop for handicrafts, textiles, and souvenirs typical of Agra. Dinner and rest at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:18:55', '2026-08-21 08:18:55'),
(7835, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 145, 6, 'Agra – Delhi - Departure (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang, Makan Malam, Meals on Board)', 'DEL (23.10) - KUL (07.05)+1 by MH 191. Breakfast at the hotel. Return to Delhi (approx. 4-5 hours). Upon arrival in Delhi, lunch at a local restaurant and visit Jama Masjid, one of the largest mosques in India. Pass by India Gate, the President\'s House, and the Parliament House. Dinner at a local restaurant, then transfer to the airport for the flight back to Indonesia.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:18:55', '2026-08-21 08:18:55'),
(7836, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 145, 7, 'Departure – Jakarta (Meals on Board)', 'KUL (09.00) - CGK (10.10) by MH 711. Connecting flight back to Jakarta. This memorable tour comes to an end — see you on the next tour with us.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-21 08:18:55', '2026-08-21 08:18:55'),
(7837, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 1, 'Jakarta – Amsterdam x-Doha', 'CGK (08.45) - DOH (13.25) | DOH (15.25) - AMS (20.20) by QR. Gather at Soekarno-Hatta International Airport Terminal 3 for the flight to Amsterdam via Doha. Upon arrival in Amsterdam, transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', 'Ozo Hotels Antares Airport 3*/Similar', 'Meals on Flight', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7838, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 2, 'Amsterdam – Zaanse Schans – Volendam - Monheim', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Zaanse Schans for a photo stop at the Windmills of Zaanse Schans and the Cheese & Clog Factory. The journey continues to Volendam to visit the Fisherman Village. Photo stops at Dam Square in the city centre, Royal Coaster Diamonds, and Amsterdam Central Station. Transfer to Monheim for the overnight stay.', 'Hey Lou Monheim am Rhein 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7839, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 3, 'Monheim - Cologne - Brussels - Charleroi', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Cologne for photo stops at Cologne Cathedral, Groß St. Martin, and the Grand Mosque. Continue to Brussels for photo stops at the Grand Place and the Manneken Pis statue.', 'Ibis Charleroi Centre Gare 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7840, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 4, 'Charleroi La Vallee Village - Paris', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to La Vallee Village for shopping at the La Vallee Village Designer Outlet.', 'B&B Paris Meudon Velizy 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7841, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 5, 'Paris - Metz', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Paris city tour with photo stops at the Champs-Élysées, Notre-Dame de Paris, Place de la Concorde, Arc de Triomphe, the Louvre Museum, the Eiffel Tower, Galeries Lafayette Haussmann, and the Seine riverbanks.', 'Ibis Metz Nord 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7842, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 6, 'Metz - Luxembourg - Strasbourg - Mulhouse', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Luxembourg for photo stops at Notre-Dame Cathedral and the Grand Ducal Palace. Continue to Strasbourg for photo stops at the Palais Rohan, Strasbourg Cathedral, and La Petite France.', 'Ibis Mulhouse Centre Filature 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7843, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 7, 'Mulhouse - Lucerne - Rheinfall - Zurich', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Lucerne for photo stops at Lake Lucerne, the Lion Monument, Lucerne Old Town, and Chapel Bridge. Continue to Rheinfall for a photo stop at the Rhine Falls (entrance not included).', 'Zleep Hotel Zurich Kloten 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7844, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 8, 'Zurich - Jakarta x-Doha', 'ZRH (15.10) - DOH (22.50). Breakfast at the hotel. Photo stop at Fraumünster Church, shopping at Bahnhofstrasse. Transfer to the airport for the return flight home via Doha.', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7845, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 147, 9, 'Arrival Jakarta', 'DOH (02.40) - CGK (15.10). Arrive in Jakarta. Thank you for choosing us as your travel companion.', NULL, 'No Meals', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7846, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 1, 'Jakarta – Paris x-Doha', 'CGK (00.20) - DOH (04.50) | DOH (08.05) - CDG (13.15). Gather at Soekarno-Hatta International Airport Terminal 3 for the flight to Paris via Doha.', NULL, 'Meals on Flight', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7847, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 2, 'Paris – La Vallee - Paris', 'Upon arrival in Paris, city tour with photo stops at Place de la Concorde, the Champs-Élysées, Notre-Dame Cathedral, Arc de Triomphe, Les Invalides, the Louvre Museum, the Eiffel Tower, and the Seine riverbanks. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', 'B&B Hotel Paris Nord 2 CDG Aéroport 3*/Similar', 'No Meals', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7848, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 3, 'Paris – Brussels – Amsterdam', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Brussels for an orientation tour with photo stops at the Atomium, Grand Place, and Manneken Pis. Transfer to Amsterdam for check-in and rest.', 'Ibis Styles Almere 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7849, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 4, 'Amsterdam – Zaanse Schans – Volendam - Monheim', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Photo stops at Dam Square, Royal Coaster Diamonds, and the Windmills of Zaanse Schans. The journey continues to Volendam to visit the Fisherman Village. Transfer to Monheim for the overnight stay.', 'Hey Lou Monheim am Rhein 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7850, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 5, 'Monheim - Cologne - Roermond - Luxembourg', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Cologne for photo stops at Cologne Cathedral (UNESCO-listed) and the Cologne Central Mosque, then Designer Outlet Roermond, Notre-Dame Cathedral, Place de la Constitution, the equestrian statue of Guillaume II, and the Grand Ducal Palace.', 'Mercure Hotel Saarbrücken Süd 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7851, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 6, 'Luxembourg – Titisee – Neustadt - Schaffhausen - Zug', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Titisee to see Lake Titisee, the Black Forest, and a Cuckoo Clock workshop, with shopping at the Drubba Shop. Continue to Schaffhausen for a photo stop at the Rhine Falls (entrance not included).', 'Swissever Zug Swiss Quality Hotel 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7852, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 7, 'Zug – Lucerne - Engelberg - Vaduz - Milan', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Engelberg to visit Mt. Titlis (the eternal snow mountain, optional cable car). Photo stops at Lake Lucerne, the Lion Monument, the Old City, and Chapel Bridge. Photo stops at Vaduz Town Hall, St. Florin Cathedral, and the Government Building. The journey continues to Milan. Note: if all participants choose to join the optional Mt. Titlis excursion, an additional charge will apply and the Vaduz itinerary will be cancelled.', 'Best Western Hotel Goldenmile Milan 4*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7853, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 8, 'Milan - Jakarta x-Doha', 'MXP (22.10) - DOH (05.55)+1. Breakfast at the hotel. Photo stops at the Galleria Vittorio Emanuele, Duomo di Milano, Castello Sforzesco, and Teatro alla Scala. Transfer to the airport for the flight home.', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7854, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 148, 9, 'Doha - Jakarta', 'DOH (08.45) - CGK (21.25). Arrive in Jakarta. Thank you for choosing us as your travel companion.', NULL, 'No Meals', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7855, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 1, 'Jakarta – Paris x-Dubai', 'CGK (17.40) - DXB (22.30) | DXB (04.00) - CDG (09.20). Gather at Soekarno-Hatta International Airport Terminal 3 for the flight to Paris, France.', NULL, 'Meals on Flight', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7856, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 2, 'Arrival Paris - Paris', 'Upon arrival in Paris, head straight to shopping at La Vallee Village Designer Outlet (Louis Vuitton, Hermes, Celine, Gucci, and more). Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', 'Ibis Styles Paris Gennevilliers 3*/Similar', 'No Meals', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7857, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 3, 'Paris City Tour', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Paris city tour with photo stops at the Champs-Élysées, Eiffel Tower, Place de la Concorde, the Panthéon, Notre-Dame de Paris, the Louvre Museum, Arc de Triomphe, and the Seine riverbanks. Shopping at Galeries Lafayette. Transfer to the hotel for rest.', 'Ibis Styles Paris Gennevilliers 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7858, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 4, 'Paris - Brussels - Amsterdam', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Brussels for a city tour with photo stops at the Grand Place and the Manneken Pis statue. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', 'Ozo Hotels Antares Airport 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7859, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 5, 'Amsterdam - Zaanse Schans - Volendam - Monheim', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Zaanse Schans for a photo stop at the Windmills of Zaanse Schans. Visit the Fisherman Village of Volendam. Photo stops at Dam Square in the city centre and Amsterdam Central Station. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', 'Hey Lou Monheim am Rhein 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7860, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 6, 'Monheim - Cologne - Luxembourg - Metz', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Cologne for a city tour with photo stops at Cologne Cathedral, Groß St. Martin, and the Grand Mosque. Continue to Luxembourg for photo stops at Place de la Constitution, the Palais Grand-Ducal, and Notre-Dame Cathedral of Luxembourg. Head to Metz for a photo stop at Metz Cathedral. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', 'Ibis Metz Centre Cathedrale 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54');
INSERT INTO `itineraries` (`id`, `itinerable_type`, `itinerable_id`, `day_number`, `title`, `description`, `hotel_info`, `meals_info`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(7861, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 7, 'Metz - Titisee - Neustadt - Schaffhausen - Zurich', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Titisee-Neustadt for a photo stop at Lake Titisee, see the Black Forest, and the Cuckoo Clock at Drubba Mal. Head to Schaffhausen for a photo stop at the Rhine Falls (entrance not included). Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest.', 'Zleep Hotel Zurich Kloten 3*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7862, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 8, 'Zurich - Titlis - Lucerne - Vaduz - Milan', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Head to Engelberg to visit Mt. Titlis (the eternal snow mountain, optional cable car). Photo stops at Lake Lucerne, the Lion Monument, Lucerne Old Town, and Chapel Bridge. Transfer to the hotel for check-in and rest. Note: if all participants choose to join the optional Mt. Titlis tour, an additional charge will apply and the Vaduz itinerary will be cancelled.', 'Best Western Hotel Goldenmile 4*/Similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7863, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 9, 'Milan - Jakarta x-Dubai', 'MXP (21.20) - DXB (06.30). After breakfast, photo stops at the Galleria Vittorio Emanuele II, Duomo di Milano, Castello Sforzesco, and San Siro Stadium. Transfer to the airport for the return flight home via Dubai.', NULL, 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7864, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 149, 10, 'Dubai - Jakarta', 'DXB (10.55) - CGK (22.10). The journey continues to Jakarta. Thank you for choosing us as your travel companion.', NULL, 'No Meals', '2026-08-24 11:59:54', '2026-08-24 11:59:54'),
(7865, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 1, 'Jakarta – Sydney (Meals on Board)', 'CGK (11.10) - KUL (14.20) by MH 710 or CGK (15.40) - KUL (18.50) by MH 720 & KUL (20.30) - SYD (07.55)+1 by MH 251 or KUL (22.40) - SYD (10.20)+1 by MH 123. Gather at Soekarno-Hatta Airport terminal 3 for departure to Sydney with Malaysia Airlines.', NULL, 'Overnight on board the plane, meals on board', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40'),
(7866, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 2, 'Sydney City Tour (Makan Siang)', 'Upon arrival in Sydney, visit Sydney Opera House (photo stop). Continue to The Rocks & Circular Quay. Photo stop at Mrs. Macquarie\'s Chair. Head to Chinatown & CBD and Darling Harbour. After lunch, visit Bondi Beach. Pass through the Kings Cross area and Rose Bay. Photo stop at The Gap. If time permits, visit Paddy\'s Market or QVB Mall. Check in to the hotel and rest. (Note: destinations may be adjusted according to arrival time, flight schedule, and local operational conditions.)', 'Hotel *3/similar', 'Lunch', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40'),
(7867, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 3, 'Sydney – Blue Mountain – Sydney (Makan Pagi, Makan Malam)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to Blue Mountain, Australia\'s national protected forest. Visit Echo Point Lookout & The Three Sisters Rocks (photo stop). Enjoy the Ultimate Discovery Pass attractions (Railway, Skyway, Cableway at Scenic World). In the afternoon, return to Sydney via Leura Village. Return to the hotel and rest.', 'Hotel *3/similar', 'Breakfast, Dinner', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40'),
(7868, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 4, 'Sydney Free Day (Makan Pagi)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Free time to explore Sydney independently (No Transport, No Guide, No Tour Leader).', 'Hotel *3/similar', 'Breakfast', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40'),
(7869, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 5, 'Sydney – Melbourne (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', 'Domestic flight Sydney – Melbourne. Breakfast at the hotel, check out and transfer to the airport for the flight to Melbourne. Upon arrival in Melbourne, city tour: Parliament House Melbourne (photo stop), St. Patrick\'s Cathedral (photo stop), Captain Cook\'s Cottage (photo stop), MCG, Rod Laver Arena, Royal Botanic Garden, Shrine of Remembrance (photo stop), National Gallery Victoria, Victorian Arts Centre, Federation Square, and Flinders Street Station. Check in to the hotel and rest. (Note: destinations may be adjusted according to arrival time, flight schedule, and local operational conditions.)', 'Hotel *3/similar', 'Breakfast, Lunch', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40'),
(7870, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 6, 'Melbourne – Ballarat – Melbourne (Makan Pagi, Makan Malam)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Visit Ballarat Wildlife Park to interact with native Australian animals (kangaroos, koalas, wombats). Visit Sovereign Hill, an area styled in Cowboy-era fashion and Victorian-era clothing. Return to Melbourne to rest.', 'Hotel *3/similar', 'Breakfast, Dinner', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40'),
(7871, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 7, 'Melbourne – Departure (Makan Pagi, Makan Siang)', 'Breakfast at the hotel. Shopping at Queen Victoria Market, DFO South Wharf/Bourke Street Mall/Emporium Melbourne. Transfer to the airport for the flight back to Indonesia. (Note: destinations may be adjusted according to arrival time, flight schedule, and local operational conditions.)', NULL, 'Breakfast, Lunch', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40'),
(7872, 'App\\Models\\InternationalTour', 150, 8, 'Departure – Jakarta (Meals on Board)', 'MEL (00.30) - KUL (05.45) by MH 128, KUL (07.25) - CGK (08.30) by MH 713 or KUL (09.10) - CGK (10.20) by MH 711. Return flight to Jakarta. This memorable tour comes to an end — see you on our next tour together.', NULL, 'Meals on Board', '2026-08-24 12:17:40', '2026-08-24 12:17:40');
